\pard\intbl\cell\par
<pc> receives the iron ore!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But that is not all!\par
I must reward you further\emdash\par
This tome, too, is yours!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You have learned a lot\emdash\par
About mining, about ore...\par
And about yourself!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: A smith without ore\emdash\par
Bereft as a winter nest,\par
Birds long departed...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Remember my words:\par
Find those precious seams of ore,\par
Let your hammer swing!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Do not fear shortage\emdash\par
In time, the seam will give more,\par
Like new leaves in spring.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: How much longer must I wait...? Why must the sands torture me so...?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: ...Ah. Good day to you. You are perhaps wondering why I am standing here, yes? The truth is, I am a painter, and I am waiting for a scene worthy of being immortalised by my hand.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I have already envisaged the sort of image I would like to paint: a mighty, magnificent conflict unfolding in the desert...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Alas, the sands have yet to oblige me. There is something missing...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But what could it be...? The setting is perfect, and there are plenty of spitzfires... Ah, but of course\emdash conflict! Cataclysmic, chaotic conflict in the form of a magnificent move such as Wild Side!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Wait\emdash perhaps you could assist me! Venture out into the Celestial Sands and slay a spitzfire by unleashing your Wild Side\emdash that will provide me with a tableau truly worthy of my talents!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Surely you will not refuse a struggling artist in his hour of need?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.\par
Will you acquiesce to this request?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh. How disappointing. It would have made a wonderful painting, I am certain... Still, things cannot always be as one would like them to be...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, wonderful! A thousand thank yous! Yours is the kind of attitude that can inspire a masterpiece, I am sure!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now, before you venture out into the sands, I feel that I should remind you that Wild Side can only be performed by three very specific people. That should give you an idea of its power\emdash and its beauty!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you want to know who exactly needs to be pepped up in order to perform it, simply select \lquote Attributes\rquote  from the menu and press  to find out more about your pep powers.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now, get out there and show me the beauty of battle! I will ensure that you are immortalised on canvas!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I would like you to venture out into the Celestial Sands and slay a spitzfire by unleashing your Wild Side. That will provide me with a tableau worthy of my talents!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now remember\emdash Wild Side is a pep power that must be performed by three very specific people.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you want to know who exactly needs to be pepped up in order to perform it, simply select \lquote Attributes\rquote  from the menu and press  to find out more about your pep powers.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now, get out there and show me the beauty of battle! I will ensure that you are immortalised on canvas!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You unleashed your Wild Side and slew a spitzfire! You should go and tell the painter in front of the noticeboard in northern Gallopolis!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I saw it all! Every single moment! Even from this distance, I could sense the glorious intensity of the battle!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And do you know, inspiration for a title for my masterpiece has already struck\emdash it shall be called \lquote A Walk on the Wild Side\rquote !\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But now is not the time to be thinking of titles\emdash I must devote all my energies to completing the work itself!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah, but before I forget, I must give you something to thank you for your assistance. Please...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Truly, it has been years since I witnessed such a stimulating scene! These are the moments an artist lives for! A thousand thank yous, young man!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I have already chosen a title for my masterpiece! It shall be called \lquote A Walk on the Wild Side\rquote !\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But now is not the time to be thinking of titles\emdash I must devote all my energies to completing the work!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And as soon as it is finished, I must devote myself to my next great project: capturing the ominous majesty of Erdwin's Lantern!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh! Good day to you! I assume you are here to sample Gallopolis's world-renowned cactus cutlet?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If so, I am afraid I have bad news for you\emdash the kitchen is currently closed while I dedicate my energies to improving the recipe.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I am certain that a golden globule would intensify the flavour tenfold, but acquiring such an ingredient is easier said than done. The golden globes\emdash the cacti who carry them\emdash are extremely vicious...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah, but they would pose no problem for a young and no doubt vigorous individual such as yourself, I am sure!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Perhaps you could assist me? Would you be willing to hunt down a golden globe in order to acquire the golden globule I require in order to perfect my cutlets?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.\par
Will you acquiesce to this request?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Aha ha ha! But of course. A thousand pardons. I should never have made such a demand of a stranger. How terribly rude of me...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I shall have to make do with the ingredients I have. I will seek out other ways of improving the flavour of my cutlets. I only hope I am able to find one...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You will? Oh, praise the sands! I can assure you that you are about to play a crucial role in culinary history!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The golden globes which drop the golden globule that I require are curious beasts. They appear very occasionally alongside their cactiball brethren in combat out in the desert surrounding Gallopolis.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: They are not the most common of creatures, I confess, but if you were to engage enough cactiballs in battle, you would be sure to encounter one eventually.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I only require a single golden globule. That will be more than enough for the culinary experiments I wish to perform. I pray that it will not take too long for you to find one and deliver it to me.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My cactus cutlets require an additional...something to take their flavour to the next level, and I am keen to try using a golden globule in my next batch.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: However, the golden globes that drop them are curious beasts. They appear very occasionally alongside their cactiball brethren in combat out in the desert surrounding Gallopolis.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: They are not the most common of creatures, I confess, but if you were to engage enough cactiballs in battle, you would be sure to encounter one eventually.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I only require a single golden globule. That will be more than enough for the culinary experiments I wish to perform. I pray that it will not take too long for you to find one and deliver it to me.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You got a golden globule! You should take it to the chef at the Aloe Beera in Gallopolis.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah! Good day to you. Does your presence here mean that you have brought me a golden globule?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh... That is rather disappointing, I must confess...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But I have faith in you still! You are the only one who can acquire one for me\emdash and I am fully confident that you will!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: By the sands\emdash a golden globule! Is it not so much more charming than any ordinary cactus? And its texture appears to be perfect! This will make for a most satisfying cutlet indeed!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Perhaps I should sample a small piece of it raw... (nibble) Hmm... (munch) Oh! It is so rich and juicy! And so very sharp\emdash just as a cactus should be!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My cactus cutlets will soon taste better than ever, of that I am absolutely certain!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: A thousand thank yous, friend! You have improved the lives of cutlet-lovers everywhere! Please, allow me to give you a little something in return...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Golden globes are not the only rarefied forms of regular monsters. Seeking others out would provide you with valuable experience, I am sure.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah, good day to you, friend! I am pleased to report that as a result of your heroics, my cactus cutlets are growing tastier every day!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I am not quite satisfied just yet, however. Rest assured that you will be the first to sample the new recipe as soon as it has been perfected!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Golden globes are not the only rarefied forms of regular monsters. Seeking others out would provide you with valuable experience, I am sure.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The city of Gondolia lies beyond this checkpoint. It is known for its busy port, and for the crowds of people that throng its streets.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Somewhere among those crowds is my dear little sister. She went to Gondolia to pursue her career, and has been too busy to come home since. I dearly hope that she is well...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Greetings, traveller. My name is Hakim. Please pardon my impertinence, but I assume you are making the journey to Gondolia? If so, I have a favour I would like to ask of you.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hakim\cell I have a sister, you see. Her name is Akia, and she works in a bakery in the city.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hakim\cell It seems she has been very busy of late, and has been unable to come home and visit as a result. As such, I have written her a letter.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hakim\cell Unfortunately, I am not permitted to leave my post. Would you be so good as to deliver the letter to Akia on my behalf?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.\par
Will you acquiesce to this request?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hakim\cell ...I understand. It was most impudent of me to ask such a favour of a stranger. Forgive me, please.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hakim\cell You will!? Oh, praise the sands! Only one with a truly kind heart would agree to assist a stranger in this manner!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hakim\cell Here is the letter I would like you to deliver. I do not need to tell you this, of course, but its contents are very important. Do not lose it, please!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell <pc> receives Hakim's letter.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hakim\cell Akia works in a bakery in the north-western part of Gondolia. I would be most grateful if you could deliver the letter to her there.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Doge Rotondo is rightly revered as the greatest merchant in all of Gondolia. I consider it an honour to be in his employ!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you are no sure what to buy, I recommend the cream cake. Is fresh from the oven! It tastes like the heaven! Molto delizioso!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Is so tiring, working in the bakery from the morning until the night. Now I finish, I want to eat something sweet. Allora, what I choose today...?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hakim\cell Please, you must deliver the letter I gave you to my sister in Gondolia.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hakim\cell She works in a bakery in the north-western part of the city. I would be most grateful if you could deliver the letter to her there.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Hm? You are looking for a young lady named Akia? Well...my name is Akia. Do you think I might be the one you are looking for?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Akia\cell No? Are you sure? There are no other people of that name in Gondolia...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Akia\cell Oh! Is this...a letter from Hakim!? A thousand thank yous! I shall read it right away! Let me see...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote My dearest Akia,\par
Are you well? I hope that your apprenticeship at the bakery is not proving to be too draining. I am certain that you will do well there.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote After all, you have always been such a hard worker, ever since you were a little girl.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote Now that the misery of our old life is a thing of the past, I pray that you are enjoying your freedom. I cannot wait to see you blossom into a fully fledged baker.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote I have enclosed a few gold coins. Hopefully they will make life a little easier for you. I very much hope to see you one day soon\emdash and to taste one of your delicious cakes! With all my love, Hakim\rquote\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Akia\cell Oh, poor Hakim... How he must scrimp and save in order to send me money...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Akia\cell I must write him my own letter in response. Wait a moment, please. It will not take long.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell <pc> waits while Akia writes her letter...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Akia\cell I realise that this is quite the imposition, but would you mind returning to the western checkpoint and delivering this to Hakim?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell <pc> receives Akia's letter.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Akia\cell Also, I would very much appreciate it if you did not tell my brother that I no longer work at the bakery. That is something I would like to tell him myself when the time is right.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Akia\cell A thousand thank yous for your kind assistance, friend. May the sun smile upon you always.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell When you have time, you should go and deliver Akia's letter to her brother Hakim at the checkpoint west of Gallopolis.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Eh? \lquote Akia\rquote ? A letter from my brother? No, no, no! My name is no Akia, and I have no brother! You talk to the wrong person, signore!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: S\f0\'ec, Akia work here before, but then she finish. Finito!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Is a shame\f1\emdash\f0 she is a talented baker. But she say to me she find the better job. I think now she work for Doge Rotondo as a maid.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Allora, I see her today, just near the house of the Doge. She seemed to be molto, molto busy. If you meet with her, say \lquote ciao\rquote  from me!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hakim\cell Oh! You have returned! Did you see my sister? How is she? Is she well?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell Give Akia's letter to Hakim?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hakim\cell Hm? Why will you not answer me? This is hardly very polite...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hakim\cell Oh! Is this...? It is! A letter from my dearest Akia! A thousand thank yous for bringing it to me! I cannot wait to see what it says...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote Dear Hakim,\par
I received your letter. Thank you. Thank you also for the money. I know that it cannot be easy for you to have to support us both.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote If it were not for your assistance, I would be unable to follow my dream of becoming a baker. I am learning so much here. Only the other day, my master mentioned how much I had improved.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote I will continue to work hard, Hakim. I want you to be proud of me.\par
With all my love,\par
Akia\rquote\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hakim\cell Aha ha! Dear little Akia! She sounds as though she is doing well\f1\emdash\f0 and working hard!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hakim\cell In truth, life has not been easy for her. Our father did not treat us well...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hakim\cell He was once a kind and gentle man, but then he suffered a terrible injury, which made him horribly bitter. Akia and I would often bear the brunt of his frustration...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hakim\cell It was not a pleasant environment in which to grow up. Which is why I want to ensure that she can enjoy her life now that she is free of it.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hakim\cell Her letter has brought me great relief. I am indebted to you for delivering it to me. Please, accept this by way of thanks.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Akia\cell I know that it is a terrible imposition, but would you mind returning to the western checkpoint and delivering my letter to Hakim?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Akia\cell If you are kind enough to do so, I would appreciate it if you did not tell him that I no longer work at the bakery. That is something I would like to tell him myself, when the time is right...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Akia\cell A thousand thank yous for your kind assistance, friend. May the sun smile upon you always.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Akia, she work here before, but then she finish. Finito!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Is a shame\f1\emdash\f0 she is a talented baker. But she say to me she find the better job. I think now she work for Doge Rotondo as a maid.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Allora, I see her today, just near the house of the Doge. She seemed to be molto, molto busy. If you meet with her, say \lquote ciao\rquote  from me!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hakim\cell Life has not been easy for Akia. Our father did not treat us well...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hakim\cell He was once a kind and gentle man, but then he suffered a terrible injury, which made him horribly bitter. Akia and I would often bear the brunt of his frustration...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hakim\cell It was not a pleasant environment in which to grow up. Which is why I want to ensure that she can enjoy her life now that she is free of it.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hakim\cell Her letter brought me great relief. I am indebted to you for delivering it to me.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Akia\cell Good day to you! Please, allow me to thank you once more for your fine delivery work.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Akia\cell Hakim's letter brought me great comfort. It is a most pleasant feeling to know that we are connected despite being so far apart.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Akia\cell Oh! It is you! The one who delivered Hakim's letter! Your timing could not be better. I find myself in need of your assistance once more...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Akia\cell Could you deliver another letter for me, please? This time it is going to Puerto Valor, to a gentleman who lives there by the name of Valentino.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.\par
Will you acquiesce to this request?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Akia\cell Oh... I was under the impression that you liked nothing better than making deliveries. I suppose I must have been mistaken...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Akia\cell A thousand thank yous! Here is the letter.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell <pc> receives Akia's letter.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Akia\cell In order to travel to Puerto Valor, you must sail to the north-west. Valentino will not be difficult to find when you arrive there, I am sure.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Akia\cell Please be aware that my letter tells Valentino everything, including the fact that I abandoned my career as a baker to come and work here.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Akia\cell As such, it would be a disaster for me if it fell into the wrong hands. You must take great care of it, and ensure that it reaches its destination safely.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Hm? You are a new client? Lo siento, se\'f1or. I am sorry, but I am on holiday at the moment. Perhaps you can come and see me when I am back at work, s\'ed?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Sorry? What kind of work do I do? \'a1Je je! Then you are not a client? Honestly, I think it is better if you do not know...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Yes? Can I help you? Ha. I doubt it. Who would require the help of a simple stable boy...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Of course, I was not always a stable boy. No\f1\emdash\f0 once I was a celebrated horseman. The name \lquote Abu\rquote  rang out from every corner of the racetrack. Until my fall, that is...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Abu\cell But while I may no longer be able to ride, it still pleases me to be near my beloved horses. There are certainly worse situations in which I could have found myself.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Abu\cell Now, that is quite enough of my tale of woe. I must return to work. I am sure to lose my job if my superiors catch me idling.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Akia\cell In order to travel to Puerto Valor, you must sail to the north-west. Valentino will not be difficult to find when you arrive there, I am sure.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Akia\cell Please be aware that my letter tells Valentino everything, including the fact that I abandoned my career as a baker to come and work here.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Akia\cell As such, it would be a disaster for me if it fell into the wrong hands. You must take great care of it, and ensure that it reaches its destination safely.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \'bfQu\'e9? You are searching for a man by the name of Valentino? Then se\'f1or, you have found him.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell Give Akia's letter to Valentino?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Valentino\cell So now you have found me, you have nothing to say? Ay ay ay... Please, do not waste my time. I am trying to enjoy my holiday.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Valentino\cell A letter for me? There is only one person who would write me a letter. It is from Akia in Gondolia, s\'ed? Ay, it has been a very long time. Let me see what she has to say...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote Dear Doctor,\par
It has been a while, has it not? My apologies for not writing since I last visited.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote But I have good news! I finally have the money! I can finally pay you to treat my father's leg!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote We must hurry, Doctor! Please, come to Gondolia right away!\par
Yours expectantly,\par
Akia\rquote\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Valentino\cell\'a1Mi querida! The poor dear child... Akia has still not given up the hope that Abu's leg may one day be healed...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Valentino\cell Ah, but perhaps I should explain. As you just heard, I am a doctor. Akia heard of my reputation, and came to me to ask if I could treat her papi's injured leg.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Valentino\cell But at the time, I could not help her. \'a1Ay de m\'ed! The treatment required by her papi cost far more than she could afford...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Valentino\cell I believe that is why she abandoned her career as a baker\f1\emdash\f0 she wanted to earn more money so that she could save up and pay for the treatment of her papi.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Valentino\cell ...Unfortunately, it is impossible for me to treat her father's injury. Please, take this letter to Akia. It is very important\f1\emdash\f0 muy importante, s\'ed? She must know the truth of the situation.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You've received an important letter. Deliver it to Akia on the east side of the main street in Gondolia.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Akia\cell Welcome back! You delivered my letter to Valentino, yes? Well? How did he react?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Akia\cell ...What!? N-No... Surely not...! He refuses to treat my father!? But...why?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell Give Akia the important letter?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Akia\cell I-If this is a trick you are playing on me, then you are the cruellest man alive!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell <pc> gives the important letter to Akia.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Akia\cell Hm? This letter is not addressed to me\f1\emdash\f0 it is addressed to Valentino...and the sender is...?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Akia\cell\lquote A-A-Abu\rquote !? My father...?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Akia\cell Wh-Why is my father sending letters to Valentino? And why are you delivering them to me? Perhaps things will become clearer if I read it. Let me see...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote Doctor Valentino,\par
I have heard that my daughter visited you, and asked you to treat my leg.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote You must do something for me, Doctor: if Akia offers to pay for my treatment, I would ask that you refuse.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote I would also ask that you give her the few coins which I enclose in this envelope. Tell her that they are to help her follow her dream of becoming a baker.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote I have saved up this small sum through my work in the stables, in the hope that they might help my dear daughter.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote I have been a terrible father to my children. Nothing I do now will ever change that. But I would like to try and help in this at least. Thank you, Doctor. Your humble servant, Abu\rquote\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Akia\cell I... I see... So my father knew about my plan. In truth, I thought he had forgotten all about me...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Akia\cell But it seems my career means a great deal to him... And here I am, having abandoned it all in order to try and help him...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Akia\cell He was thinking of me all along... But why make his feelings known through such roundabout means...?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Akia\cell I must thank you for bringing me this letter. It has brought my father and I together again, if only indirectly. Please, accept this as a small token of my gratitude...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hakim\cell Akia told me that she had some very important news. I left my post at the checkpoint and came here right away.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hakim\cell She has told me everything\f1\emdash\f0 of her attempts to pay for treatment for our father...and of the fact that she abandoned her baking career in order to do so...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hakim\cell To think that she would make such sacrifices for the sake of one who treated us both so badly... Who never so much as sent either of us a single letter...!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Valentino\cell Akia has been saving money to pay for her father's treatment, s\'ed? Oh querida... The poor thing... The truth is, I cannot treat her father's injuries. Es imposible...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Valentino\cell Ay, but I cannot be the one to tell her this. It is a matter for the family to solve among themselves, no?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Valentino\cell You must take this letter to Akia, se\'f1or. It is... It is very important, that is all I can say...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Akia\cell I left the bakery and abandoned my dream, all because I wished to earn money to pay for my father's treatment...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Akia\cell Little did I know that my father had also been working, despite his injury, in order to support my career...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Akia\cell But at last we understand one another\f1\emdash\f0 and that is no small thing, given the distance that was between us.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Akia\cell Our first priority must be to ensure that he receives the treatment he requires. My brother and I will remain by his side until he recovers.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hakim\cell Akia informed me of the contents of our father's letter. I was surprised to learn that he had been working so hard in order to help her achieve her dream...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hakim\cell But this does not mean that I forgive him. As far as I am concerned, Akia is the only family I have. It has always been this way, and it will always be this way.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hakim\cell She is, however, very insistent... And I do not wish to let her down...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hakim\cell Perhaps I will agree to join her and my father at next year's Sand National. She has expressed a wish for us to go there as a family, and to cheer on some of the horses that my father has been looking after...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Valentino\cell You delivered the letter I gave to you, s\'ed? Ay, I can only hope it will help to bring that poor family a little closer together...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Valentino\cell It is strange though, no? Es muy extra\'f1o... People are unable to reconcile their differences without the help of a letter delivered by someone they do not even know...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Valentino\cell But we do not know what we have until it is gone, eh? This is as true of families as it is of everything else. I pray that your little delivery will help to heal their rift...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Yes, I am Abu... Do you require something from me?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Abu\cell ...Why are you staring at me like this? Do I have something stuck to my face? We do not know each other...do we?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Abu\cell Please, if you do not require anything, I must ask you to leave me alone. I cannot neglect my work. For the sake of my children...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Abu\cell I must provide them with the money they need to follow their dreams. That is all I can hope to do for them now...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I was a terrible father to my children. That is why I decided to work my fingers to the bone to provide for them. I had given up on our being reconciled, but I did not want them to be ashamed of Abu...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Abu\cell And yet, by some miracle, they have returned to me! I cannot believe it! I feel as though I am dreaming!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Abu\cell They have told me of what you did, friend. I thank you. From the bottom of my heart. If it were not for your assistance, my family would be lost to me still.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Akia\cell Ah! It is wonderful to see you again! The world has become such a dangerous place lately, I was more than a little worried about you!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Akia\cell Thank you for all that you did for us\f1\emdash\f0 as a result of your kind efforts, we are a family once more!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hakim\cell Good day to you. A thousand thank yous once again for all that you did for my sister.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hakim\cell But there is something I would like to make clear\f1\emdash\f0 the fact that I am standing here with my father does not mean I have forgiven him.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hakim\cell It is true, however, that he is not quite the dreadful man he once was... Age has...softened him... And Akia and I are no longer children, either...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Valentino\cell\'a1Je je je! No deliveries for me today, eh? It must be a tiring job, carrying letters from one corner of Erdrea to another!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Valentino\cell Por fortuna, you are not the only one who performs this role. In fact, I received a letter from Akia only this morning. It seems their family has been reunited, no? Ay, that is wonderful news! \'a1Buenas noticias!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Did you know, traveller, that these fields were once part of a great kingdom? Zwaardsrust, they called it. In its heyday, its grandeur equalled that of Heliodor or Gallopolis.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: That is, until one night, when an enormous swarm of monsters razed the entire nation to the ground. Now, all that remain are ruins. Its former glory is but a distant memory...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But some remnants yet linger. The souls of those who were slain on that fateful night are still bound to those ruins by the weight of their grief.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Twisted by their fury at the monsters who destroyed their homeland, and by their frustration at being unable to protect it, they have become monsters themselves... Deadnauts...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When night falls, they rise from their graves and prowl the ruins of Zwaardsrust. To atone for their failure, and to assuage their wrath, they attack any whom they encounter on sight.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Traveller, those fiends were once my kinfolk. I cannot bear to see them suffer so. Will you help to end their torment and allow them to rest in peace at last?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.\par
Will you acquiesce to this request?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I see... No doubt a warrior such as yourself has more pressing issues to deal with. I only ask that once those deeds are done, you return to this place and reconsider my plea.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Thank you, my friend! My researches into the art of exorcism have led me to believe that my former countrymen will only find peace if they are purified by means of the pep power known as Care Prayer.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Your blonde-haired companion is skilled in the art of curative magic, is she not? Perhaps she might know something of this ability.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I would bid you explore the ruins of Zwaardsrust at night and meet with the deadnauts. Say a Care Prayer for their eternal souls before defeating them, and they will surely find peace at last.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you were to say a Care Prayer for their eternal souls before banishing them to the beyond, the deadnauts\f1\emdash\f0 my former countrymen\f1\emdash\f0 would surely find peace at last.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I believe it is what is termed a \lquote pep power\rquote . Your friend with the long blonde hair has an aptitude for restorative magic, has she not? Perhaps she might know something of how it might be performed.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The deadnauts emerge from their graves at night and prowl the ruins of Zwaardsrust Castle. They are ferocious foes indeed. Be careful, traveller.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You defeated a deadnaut after blessing it with a Care Prayer and saved its eternal soul! Return to the priest near the Warrior's Rest Inn and tell him the good news!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The voices... Those mournful moans that have echoed through the night air for decades... They have finally fallen silent...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You have done it, traveller! You have laid my kinfolk to rest at long last! I cannot thank you enough!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Please, allow me to give you this as a token of my gratitude...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It is not only in Zwaardsrust that tortured souls have been bound to this mortal plane and reborn as monsters.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I pray that such souls may one day find peace and make the journey back to the World Tree's holy Heart\f1\emdash\f0 the same journey you have so kindly helped my fallen kinfolk to complete.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It is not only in Zwaardsrust that tortured souls have been bound to this mortal plane and reborn as monsters.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I pray that such souls may one day find peace and make the journey back to the World Tree's holy Heart\f1\emdash\f0 the same journey you have so kindly helped my fallen kinfolk to complete.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: These days, it's not enough for a fighter just to kick butt in the arena\f1\emdash\f0 you gotta look good while you're doin' it too! That's why skincare's so important, man.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But you knew that already, right? I mean, your skin's pretty darn smooth\f1\emdash\f0 nowhere near as smooth as mine, but still, not bad!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Fightin' in the arena means performing in front of a crowd, and that means lookin' your best at all times. Bad skin's bad news out there in the ring.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But keepin' things blemish-free ain't easy when you're gettin' punched in the face all day. Luckily, mellow vera can do a real good job of fixin' up a fighter's cuts and bruises. Which is why I want some\f1\emdash\f0 bad!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It grows by this big waterfall out west near where Dundrasil used to be. Once you got some, you just need to squeeze it to get the good stuff out!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey, you travel a lot, right? How about you head over there and grab some for me? I'll make it worth your while...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.\par
Will you acquiesce to this request?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Heh. I get what's goin' on here\f1\emdash\f0 you're jealous, right? You can't handle someone havin' better skin than you? That's pathetic, man!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Sweet! Thanks, man. Guess you got a good heart as well as good skin!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, one thing you should know about mellow vera is that its roots go waaay down. Even the toughest fighter'd have trouble tryin' to pull that stuff outta the ground. You'll need to cut off a piece or somethin'.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: So you remember where I said it grows, right? You'll see it sparkling near the big waterfall out west. Cut me off a piece and bring it back, okay?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My skin's cryin' out for some mellow vera, man! It grows near the big waterfall out west near where Dundrasil used to be.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The roots go waaay down into the ground, though, so you'll need to cut off a piece. And don't keep me waitin' too long\f1\emdash\f0 I can feel my skin gettin' crusty already!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You got some mellow vera! Take it to the fighter who's worried about his skin\f1\emdash\f0 he's standing near the arena in Octagonia!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: So did you get the mellow vera?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You didn't? What a let-down... I really thought you were gonna come through for me...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You gotta hurry, man! Standin' here waitin' ain't doin' my skin no favours!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
