\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Indeed, it is known in these parts as \lquote oro gris\rquote . Grey gold... I dread to think how expensive it will become if criminals are in control of its supply...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Se\'f1or... You are a strong and capable man, s\'ed? Perhaps you would be willing to liberate my precious proper pepper from its pirate captors?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.\par
Will you acquiesce to this request?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ay... I feared that you would say this. But it is probably wise that you do not engage with such vicious criminals...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \'bf\'a1De verdad!? Truly, you will do this for me!? \'a1Oh, gracias, se\'f1or! \'a1Muchas gracias!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I have heard a rumour that the pirates' base is on a small island not so far from the city of Gondolia itself. That is probably where the stolen pepper is being stored, s\'ed?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But se\'f1or, you must be very careful. I hear that they are very fierce indeed. Muy, muy fuerte. I would not wish for you to get hurt trying to help me.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I cannot prepare my signature dish without proper pepper! Por favor, se\'f1or\f1\emdash\f0 you must recover some from the pirates!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I have heard a rumour that their base is on a small island not so far from the city of Gondolia itself. That is probably where the stolen pepper is being stored, s\'ed?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But se\'f1or, you must be very careful. I hear that they are very fierce indeed. Muy, muy fuerte. I would not wish for you to get hurt trying to help me.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: ...Hm? Come to take our precious pepper, have ye? Harr harr harr! The only thing ye'll be leavin' here with is a black eye, lad!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You got some proper pepper! You should take it to the chef at the hotel in Puerto Valor!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I cannot prepare my signature dish without proper pepper! Por favor, se\'f1or\f1\emdash\f0 you must recover some from the pirates!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell Hand over the proper pepper?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Un poco proper pepper... That is all I need to make this hotel a great success once again... But without it... \'a1Ay ay ay...!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Hm? \'a1Caramba! You have brought me some proper pepper! Muchas gracias, se\'f1or, for your courage and gallantry!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now I will be able to prepare my signature dish once again! Hungry customers will crowd the dining room to feast on my steak and kidney paella! The hotel's profits will go through the roof! \'a1Je je je!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Muchas gracias once again, se\'f1or. I could never have done what you did. Please accept this gift, on behalf of myself and the hotel...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now, let me take a sniff of my beloved spice's beautiful odour... S\'ed... S\'ed...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \'a1A-a-aaa-ch\'fa!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: \'a1Ay ay ay! \'a1No, no, no! My precious proper pepper\f1\emdash\f0 it is all over the floor! What a terrible waste! And after you went to so much trouble! So sorry, se\'f1or...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I could not believe it, se\'f1or. I thought my sneeze had blown all that precious proper pepper away before I could start cooking with it.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But it is okay! I managed to scrape up enough to prepare a batch of my delicious steak and kidney pa\f1\emdash\f0 a\f1\emdash\f0 aaa\f1\emdash\f0\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \'a1...Ay! That was too close! I would have felt very foolish indeed if I had sneezed away the last of it! Aha ha!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \'a1Hola, chico! You like bunny girls, s\'ed? I like bunny girls very much! No one in Erdrea likes bunny girls as much as me!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \'a1Hola, chico! You like bunny girls, s\'ed? I like bunny girls very much! No one in Erdrea likes bunny girls as much as me!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I have loved them ever since I was a little boy. I saw a bunny girl so beautiful that I was obsessed from that day forward! S\'ed, I admit it, I am completely loco!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ay, but the sad truth is that in all the years that have passed since then, I have never seen another who compared to my first bunny love...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But perhaps that is about to change! Chico, your amiga\f1\emdash\f0 your dark-haired lady friend\f1\emdash\f0 I think she would make a most beautiful bunny girl!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Could you give it a try? Could you prepare a bunny costume for her? Then I can try to persuade her to put it on!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.\par
Will you acquiesce to this request?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \'bf\'a1Qu\'e9!? Am I to understand that you do not share my passion for bunny girls!? \'a1Qu\'e9 sorpresa! Such a surprise! I thought that all young men loved bunny girls!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \'a1Je je je! \'a1Muchas gracias, chico! It is good to meet a young man who shares my passion for bunny girls!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now, as I am sure you know, the beautiful bunny costume is made up of three essential elements: bunny ears, a bunny suit and a pair of fishnet stockings!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I will wait here while you assemble the outfit. I cannot wait to see it, chico!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Your dark-haired friend would make a magnificent bunny girl, chico\f1\emdash\f0 I am sure of it.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: All you need do is prepare the costume. I am certain that I will be able to persuade her to try it on. Ahh, and that will make an old man very happy!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I will wait here while you prepare the outfit. I cannot wait to see it, chico!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \'a1Ay ay ay! Is the transformation complete!? Has your friend transformed into a beautiful bunny girl!?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \'a1Muy bien! Then all that remains is for her to oblige an old man and put the costume on!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: My dear! You are so very beautiful! You look every bit as maravillosa as the first bunny girl I ever saw!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: \'a1No! Even more maravillosa, in fact! \'a1S\'ed, chica! You are the most beautiful bunny girl the world has ever seen!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Not everyone can carry the bunny girl outfit, you know. It requires a certain...something. And you have it in spades!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: You agree, s\'ed, chico? You also know that your friend makes a perfect bunny girl!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Jade\cell\par
...Hmph!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell Jade stares coldly at the old man, sighs deeply, and walks off.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \'a1Ay ay ay! Angry bunnies are even more adorable! \'a1Je je je! I must thank you for your efforts, chico\f1\emdash\f0 take this, por favor...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \'a1Hola, chico! Your friend is not still angry, I hope?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ay, I can die happy now that I know there is such beauty in the world! I wish you a long, bunny-loving life, my young friend!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I don't suppose you know anything about food, do you? I'm a chef, you see. Right now I'm travelling around trying to learn more about the various cuisines of the world.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I came to Phnom Nonh to pick up some rainbow rock salt. I hear it's their most popular\f1\emdash\f0 and delicious\f1\emdash\f0 souvenir.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But when I got here, the locals told me that monsters have taken over the place they get it from. Everyone's too scared to go down there!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey\f1\emdash\f0 you look like you can handle yourself. I don't suppose you could go and get me some, could you? I only need a little pinch of the stuff.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.\par
Will you acquiesce to this request?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: No? Fair enough. It was a bit cheeky of me to ask, I suppose...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You will? Oh, that's great! Apparently they get it from a place called the Grotta della Fonte over in the Laguna di Gondolia.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's some kind of cave, by the sounds of it, and the rock salt's somewhere near the middle. I'm sure you'll have no trouble finding it.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'll be waiting for you here. Good luck down there\f1\emdash\f0 and make sure you come back in one piece, okay?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Apparently, they get the rainbow rock salt from a place called the Grotta della Fonte over in the Laguna Gondolia.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'll be waiting for you here. Good luck down there\f1\emdash\f0 and make sure you come back in one piece, okay?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You got some rainbow rock salt! Take it to chef near the church in Phnom Nonh!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, it's you! Did you manage to get the rainbow rock salt?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...You didn't? Oh, that's a shame. I've got myself all worked up about it now, though. Don't give up, will you?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You did!? Oh, that's just great! Can I have a look? ...That's strange. It looks just like normal salt. Let's see how it tastes...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh! Oh my goodness! This is sensational! It's...sweet! And...sour! And...a little bit spicy! Oh, it's just wonderful! It tastes of absolutely everything!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: There isn't any other seasoning that can compete with this for depth and complexity. I'd say rainbow rock salt deserves its reputation!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I think it's going to open all sorts of new culinary avenues for me. I'm so glad I came all this way to get some!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I have to say, I don't blame those monsters for setting up camp down in that cave, either. If I had a supply of this stuff on tap, I don't think I'd ever leave either!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Thank you so much for going down there to get it for me. Here, take this. You've done my culinary career no end of good, I'm sure of it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: That rainbow rock salt you got me is mind-blowing stuff! That's what heaven tastes like, I'm sure of it!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Every time I have a little taste of it, an idea for a new dish pops into my mind!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: What do you think of the lanterns, sir? I love them. I live for them. Keeping them alight is my life's work.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The lanterns are a symbol of Phnom Nonh, I think so. Many, many tourists come to see them, and everyone is impressed by how beautiful they are.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Unfortunately, some of the lanterns have been in use for a very, very long time. They are showing severe signs of wear and tear...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I would like to repair them, of course, but I have run out of the rainproof rayon that is required, and it is impossible for me to go and fetch more.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You see, the only way to acquire it is by hunting monsters called brollygaggers. If I tried to do that, it would surely end in disaster.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You, on the other hand... You are strong and fearless, I think so. Perhaps you could go and fetch the rainproof rayon I require?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.\par
Will you acquiesce to this request?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
