\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme de Beauvoir\cell\lquote 'Ere I will bury my memories, where ze shadow of ze birch tree zat we dreamed beneath stretches in ze evening light. All zat I leave be'ind, I leave to you, my dearest friend.\rquote\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme de Beauvoir\cell It may be merely my imagination, but I cannot 'elp thinking zat zis message is meant for me.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme de Beauvoir\cell When we were girls, my best friend and I would often sit on ze swings beneath ze old birch's branches and speak of what our lives would be like when we were grandes personnes.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
