\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote By the time you read this, I will be far, far away. The Crown Prince of Heliodor has asked for my hand in marriage, and I cannot refuse him.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote I am to be a queen, so I cannot think only of my own happiness any more. My kingdom, and my people, must come first. I am afraid that I will no longer be myself...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote But even though I may change, I will always carry the wonderful memories of the days we shared together in my heart. I will never forget you.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote So I beg you, dear friend, do not forget me. Remember the girl I was, and know that you will always be ma meilleure amie, mon \'e2me s\f2\u339?ur. My best friend...my soulmate.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote I give you my ribbon as a token of our eternal friendship. You always said how much you liked it. Now, it is yours.\rquote\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme de Beauvoir\cell ...Ah! So it is true! It is a letter from 'er\f1\emdash\f2 my dearest friend!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme de Beauvoir\cell She was ze prettiest girl in ze school\f1\emdash\f2 la plus belle fille de l'Acad\f0\'e9mie\f1\emdash\f0 with long, beautiful black hair zat she always tied with zat bright red ribbon...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme de Beauvoir\cell On ze day of our graduation, I learned zat she was to be married to ze prince of a faraway kingdom. I felt so betrayed. We 'ad such a terrible argument...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme de Beauvoir\cell Zat was ze last time I ever saw 'er. I 'eard she gave birth to a daughter, but was taken ill soon after ze child was born, and passed away... (sigh)\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme de Beauvoir\cell I 'ave always regretted what 'appened zat night... We should not 'ave fought. She was 'appy, and I should 'ave been 'appy for 'er.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme de Beauvoir\cell So many years 'ave passed since zose jours de r\'eave\f1\emdash\f0 ze dreamlike days we spent together\f1\emdash\f0 but I 'ave thought about ma belle amie every day since we said au revoir...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme de Beauvoir\cell Merci, voyageur. I thank you for bringing us together once more. Voil\'e0\f1\emdash\f0 take 'er ribbon as your reward.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
