\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Zazie\cell And it couldn't just be a bog-standard one, either. If I'm going to get out of this alive, I'm going to need a +1 version or better.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Zazie\cell Oh, and don't even think of equipping it yourself! If she finds out a boy's had his grubby mitts all over her special whip, there'll be hell to pay!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Zazie\cell My life's in your hands, adventurer. Forge me a whip fit for a queen, and let me make amends!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Zazie\cell Hello again, adventurer! How's the forging coming along? Have you managed to make a queen's whip that'll meet Madame Waloppe's ridiculously high standards yet?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Zazie\cell ...Seriously? Come on\f1\emdash\f0 my life's on the line here! If I don't get me a good quality queen's whip soon, I'll be completely up the creek!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Zazie\cell Wow! What a whip! There's no way Madame Waloppe can complain about this little beauty! This is sure to get me off the hook!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Zazie\cell In fact, even if she finds out what I did, she might reward me for throwing away her ratty old one when she sees this absolute corker! Tee hee!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Zazie\cell Thank you, adventurer. I owe you one. Here\f1\emdash\f0 you should have these.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Zazie\cell Thanks for making me that whip, adventurer! That'll stop me getting in trouble with Madame Waloppe for sure!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Zazie\cell In fact, even if she finds out what I did, she might reward me for throwing away her ratty old one when she sees this absolute corker! Tee hee!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, hello there. My name's Purscilla, and I have a problem. A secret anguish that I can't tell any of my classmates...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Purscilla\cell Ah, but I can't tell you either! In fact, you're the last person I can tell! Please, leave me alone before I say too much!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm Bashtienne, editor-in-chief of the school newsletter, \lquote Le Mini Monde\rquote ...not that you'd know it from this big, blank-blank-blank space on the noticeboard.\par
*: I'd just finished tacking up this month's issue when it got caught-caught-caught by the breeze and blew out of the window!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Bashtienne\cell And to top-top-top it all off, it was an all new-new-new format! It even had the long-awaited \lquote Ch\'e8re Ch\'e9rie\rquote  column\f1\emdash\f0 advice for the lovelorn from Madame Ch\'e9rie herself!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Bashtienne\cell I've already taken all the letters out of the tray thing for the printing press. It would take forever to put-put-put it all together again...\par
I suppose I'll just have to write-write-write this month's issue off and start work on the next one... Ohhh, but it was so good!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote DANGER!\par
Do not enter without good reason!\rquote\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell It looks like a tattered copy of some sort of school newsletter.\par
None of the articles seem particularly interesting.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, hello there. My name's Purscilla, and I have a problem. A secret anguish that I can't tell any of my classmates...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Purscilla\cell You look like a tight-lipped sort of fellow. If I share my deepest, darkest secret with you, will you promise not to tell anyone?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.\par
Will you acquiesce to this request?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Purscilla\cell I see... I'm sure you don't have time to listen to me blabber on, what with all your exciting adventuring... But if you ever do, will you let me tell you of my woes?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Purscilla\cell Mmmwah! Thank you so much! Now, have you heard of Le Mini Monde? It's our school newsletter.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Purscilla\cell Well, I heard that Madame Ch\'e9rie was starting a new column offering advice to the lovelorn, so I wrote a letter to ask her about my secret passion.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Purscilla\cell But I'm too afraid to read her answer. What if she says that he'll never be mine? My heart would break clean in two!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Purscilla\cell That's why I need someone to read it for me. But I can't ask any of my classmates\f1\emdash\f0 they can never know the unfathomable depths of my desire!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Purscilla\cell Which is where you come in. Could you go and read this month's issue of Le Mini Monde for me, and see what Madame Ch\'e9rie says I should do?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Purscilla\cell You'll find it pinned up on the noticeboard in the gallery overlooking Monsieur M\'e9daill\'e9's study.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Purscilla\cell If you can't see it, just ask Bashtienne, the editor. She's a hammerhood, so you should be able to spot her easily enough. She'll be able to tell you where to find it.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Purscilla\cell Please, you have to read Madame Ch\'e9rie's column for me and let me know what she says! I'm too scared to read it myself!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Purscilla\cell You'll find the newsletter pinned up on the noticeboard in the gallery overlooking Monsieur M\'e9daill\'e9's study.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Purscilla\cell If you can't see it, just ask Bashtienne, the editor. She's a hammerhood, so you should be able to spot her easily enough. She'll be able to tell you where to find it.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Purscilla\cell ...Whaaat!? The latest issue of Le Mini Monde blew away into the Eerie Eyrie!?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Purscilla\cell No! It can't end like this! If I don't find out how to make him mine, I'll surely die!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Purscilla\cell Please, I'm begging you! You have to go there and find it before my burning, yearning heart explodes!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm Bashtienne, editor-in-chief of the school newsletter, \lquote Le Mini Monde\rquote ...not that you'd know it from this big, blank-blank-blank space on the noticeboard.\par
*: I'd just finished tacking up this month's issue when it got caught-caught-caught by the breeze and blew out of the window!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Bashtienne\cell And to top-top-top it all off, it was an all new-new-new format! It even had the long-awaited \lquote Ch\'e8re Ch\'e9rie\rquote  column\f1\emdash\f0 advice for the lovelorn from Madame Ch\'e9rie herself!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Bashtienne\cell Were you hoping to get-get-get some advice yourself? I'm sorry, but it would take me far too long to reprint it. I've decided to write-write-write this issue off and start work on the next one instead.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Bashtienne\cell If you're absolutely desperate to read the Madame Ch\'e9rie column, you'll just have to hunt-hunt-hunt down the one and only copy.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Bashtienne\cell It blew-blew-blew away in the direction of the Eerie Eyrie. I'll wager that some kindly monster has found it and stuck-stuck-stuck it up on a signpost somewhere.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Bashtienne\cell ...Why do I think-think-think that? Because it was a masterpiece, of course! Even the meanest monster would recognise its genius, and want-want-want to share it with the whole world!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell It looks like a tattered copy of some sort of school newsletter.\par
This must be Le Mini Monde!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell <pc> takes a closer look...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote Le Mini Monde, Issue 2238\par
Ch\'e8re Ch\'e9rie \f1\endash\f0  Madame Ch\'e9rie's Letters from the Lovelorn\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote Ch\'e8re Ch\'e9rie,\par
I've fallen in love with a man of a different species!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote It was love at first sight! And now I can't get the thought of his beautiful, silky-smooth hair out of my mind! Whatever should I do?\par
\f1\emdash\f0 Kissy Lips\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote Ma Ch\'e8re Kissy Lips,\par
Firstly, pay the boy's species no heed. Remember\f1\emdash\f0 love knows no boundaries!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote What you must do is to share a secret with the target of your affections. It matters not what this secret is\f1\emdash\f0 the excitement of your petite conspiracy will set his heart aflutter for certain!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote All that will be left then is to convince him that the pounding in his heart is caused by his love for you! Achieve this, and a happy future together is assured!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote Good luck, Miss Kissy Lips. I pray for your victory on the battlefield of the heart!\par
With all my love, Madame Ch\'e9rie\rquote\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You found the missing edition of Le Mini Monde! You should head back to l'Acad\'e9mie de Notre Ma\'eetre des M\'e9dailles and pass Madame Ch\'e9rie's advice on to Purscilla!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Purscilla\cell ...You found it, didn't you? Your trembling lips tell me you have something important to say! Tell me\f1\emdash\f0 what was Madame Ch\'e9rie's advice? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell <pc> repeats Madame Ch\'e9rie's answer to Purscilla's problem.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Purscilla\cell ...So, I should share a secret with the target of my affections, should I? Tee hee hee! I knew that's what she would say!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Purscilla\cell Which is why I told you all this in the first place! ...Well? Do you see what I'm trying to tell you? Do the plaintive cries of my aching, breaking heart reach your ears? \f3\u9829?\f0 <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Purscilla\cell Ugh, you're such a meanie! I know you know, you know! Stop toying with my girlish emotions!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Purscilla\cell Hmph! You've really ruined the mood now! Let's start again from the beginning, shall we?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Purscilla\cell I was visiting Mummy and Daddy back in Heliodor when I first saw you, racing through the long grass like a wild stallion! You looked at me and smiled...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Purscilla\cell Ever since that moment, I have been a prisoner to my passion! I am yours, <pc>\f1\emdash\f0 now and forever!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Purscilla\cell But you're in the middle of an adventure, aren't you? Well, don't worry about me for the time being. Let our love ripen, and it will taste all the sweeter when it's finally time for us to be together!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Purscilla\cell Farewell for now, my darling! Take this to remember me by.\par
Oh, and this\f1\emdash\f0 mmmmmmmmmwah! \f3\u9829?\f0\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Purscilla\cell You must go off on your adventures, and I must stay here and complete my education. But don't worry, my darling\f1\emdash\f0 no matter how long cruel fate keeps us apart, I'll stay true!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Purscilla\cell After all, I cannot give my heart away, for it is already yours! Mmmmmmmmmwah! \f3\u9829?\f0\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hello! I'm Conchella, and I'm a shell slime. If anyone asks you what's got a foot but no legs, the answer is...me! Hee hee hee! I love a good riddle!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Conchella\cell I'm just putting the finishing touches on my most mind-bending, brain-straining riddles yet. As soon as they're ready, I'll challenge you to a royal riddle bonanza!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Conchella\cell Hello, traveller! It's me, Conchella! How do you fancy testing your puzzle-solving skills in a right royal riddling spectacular?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.\par
Will you acquiesce to this request?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Conchella\cell Too busy to strain your brain, eh? Come back when your shoelaces come untied\f1\emdash\f0 I mean, when you're at a loose end!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Conchella\cell Yay! You're a first-rate recreation, traveller\f1\emdash\f0 a good sport! Now, let the games begin!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Conchella\cell Riddle me this\f1\emdash\f0 what sort of single-handed sword sounds like you should pilfer it?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Conchella\cell If you think you know the answer, equip it and come and show me!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Conchella\cell What sort of single-handed sword sounds like you should pilfer it?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Conchella\cell This riddle's an unyielding unit\f1\emdash\f0 a hard one\f1\emdash\f0 so I'll give you a clue...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Conchella\cell What do you think the sword would say if it wanted you to pilfer it? \lquote Snatch me\rquote ? \lquote Pinch me\rquote ? ...\lquote Steal me\rquote ?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Conchella\cell Oh dear, I think I've presented the pastime\f1\emdash\f0 I've given the game away! If you've worked out what the answer is, equip it and come and show me!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Conchella\cell So, you think that's the answer, do you? Let's see... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Conchella\cell ...That's it! You've exercised the answer, traveller\f1\emdash\f0 you've worked it out! The single-handed sword that sounds like you should pilfer it is...a steel broadsword!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Conchella\cell Get it? \lquote Steel broadsword\rquote ! \lquote STEAL broadsword\rquote ! Hee hee hee!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Conchella\cell Not bad, not bad, but the game's not over yet! I've got another perplexing problem for you!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Conchella\cell This one's like a short-tempered cactiball\f1\emdash\f0 it's particularly prickly! Alright, here we go...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Conchella\cell Riddle me this\f1\emdash\f0 what sort of weapon sounds like it's made to frustrate something that's flagging?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Conchella\cell If you think you know the answer, equip it and come and show me!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Conchella\cell What sort of weapon sounds like it's made to frustrate something that's flagging? Have you worked out the answer yet?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Conchella\cell This is a tricky one, even for a cranium container\f1\emdash\f0 a brainbox\f1\emdash\f0 like you! I'll give you a clue...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Conchella\cell Whatever this weapon is, it frustrates things that are flagging, it defuses damp squibs, it declines defeats! ...It foils fiz\f1\emdash\f0\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Conchella\cell ...Oops! I think I've freed the feline\f1\emdash\f0 I've let the cat out of the bag! If you think you know the answer, then equip it and come and show it to me!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Conchella\cell Hmm... So you think that's the answer, do you? Interesting... Very interesting... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Conchella\cell You're a perished privilege, traveller\f1\emdash\f0 you're dead right! The answer was a Fizzle foil all along!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Conchella\cell To flag is to fizzle, and to frustrate is to foil. That's why the weapon that sounds like it's made to frustrate things that are flagging is a Fizzle foil!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Conchella\cell I didn't think anybody would be able to solve my two most brain-straining riddles, but you did it! You're a set of smart shoes alright\f1\emdash\f0 a real clever clogs!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Conchella\cell You win the riddle competition, and here's your reward\f1\emdash\f0 a set of small sovereigns!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Conchella\cell I thought I was the queen of conundrums, but now I see that I'm decidedly distant\f1\emdash\f0 I've got a long way to go. But I won't give up! My next set of riddles will leave you like a chopped-down tree\f1\emdash\f0 stumped!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Ahh, it's so peaceful here... There ain't no place like Lonalulu for an old-timer to live out his autumn years...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Oh, hey, friend. Looks like you ain't from around here. A traveller, huh? Good for you. When I was your age, I travelled the world too.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I can see that same thirst for adventure in your eyes... Man, I got into so many scrapes back then! You too, right? It looks like you know how to handle yourself, though.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But adventuring ain't about looking for trouble. It's about finding yourself\f1\emdash\f0 you leave home a kid, and you come back a man!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Guess it musta been fate that brought you here, 'cause I know just the thing to send you racing down that road to manhood!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Far to the west of here, there's an island of giants. And night clubbers are some of the worst. All you gotta do is beat one of those using a certain special skill.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hyeh heh heh! What do you say? Want to make a man of yourself, kid?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.\par
Will you acquiesce to this request?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hyeh heh heh! Don't sweat it, kid. You don't gotta grow up just yet. But if you ever want to put some hairs on your chest, come back and talk to me!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hyeh heh heh! That's the spirit, kid! Okay then, let me fill you in\f1\emdash\f0 the special skill you gotta use is a pep power called \lquote Buff-Buff\rquote .\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's, uhh...how can I put this...? Actually, maybe you're better off finding out for yourself. Once you've learned it, you'll see what it's all about.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You'll be needing to unleash a move called Unbridled Blade\f1\emdash\f0 you really gotta put your back into that one. And one of your friends, well...she'll need to use a different part of her body...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hyeh heh heh! I'll say no more! Once you've worked out how to use it, get yourself over to that island of giants and take a night clubber down with Buff-Buff!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Next time I see you, you'll be well on your way to manhood. Maika'i pomaika'i, kid\f1\emdash\f0 good luck!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You ready to take your next big step on the road to manhood, kid? Then get yourself over to that island of giants far to the west and take down a night clubber using Buff-Buff!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's a pep power that's a combination of Unbridled Blade and, uhh...a certain other special skill... Hyeh heh heh! You'll have to figure out which one it is for yourself!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Next time I see you, you'll be well on your way to manhood. Maika'i pomaika'i, kid\f1\emdash\f0 good luck!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You defeated a night clubber using Buff-Buff! Head back to the bar in Lonalulu and let the old man know that you've done as he asked!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hyeh heh heh! You did it! I can see it in your eyes\f1\emdash\f0 you ain't a kid no more!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now you know the true power of the Puff-Puff! You've seen it for yourself! You've felt it burning inside you!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You've taken a big step on the road to manhood, but you won't be a real man until you've learned to channel that power\f1\emdash\f0 to be the master of your own emotions.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You got a long way to go, friend, but you don't gotta rush it. Just take it one eyeful at a time!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Here\f1\emdash\f0 take this. It's my way of thanking you for reminding me of the good old days.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Back when I was your age, me and my hoaloha\f1\emdash\f0 my best friend\f1\emdash\f0 set off on a journey all around Erdrea.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Chalky, his name was. We travelled from town to town looking for adventure\f1\emdash\f0 trying to make men of ourselves.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's funny, but you kinda remind me of him, you know. I wonder what happened to the old coot...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Back when I was your age, me and my hoaloha\f1\emdash\f0 my best friend\f1\emdash\f0 set off on a journey all around Erdrea.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Chalky, his name was. We travelled from town to town looking for adventure\f1\emdash\f0 trying to make men of ourselves.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's funny, but you kinda remind me of him, you know. I wonder what happened to the old coot...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Heh heh heh! Take a good look, kid\f1\emdash\f0 this is what a real fisherman's body looks like! Any monsters that climb on board my ship take one look at me and jump right back into the sea!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Man, where did it go? If I don't find it, it's only a matter of time before the rest of the guys realise I'm a\f1\emdash\f0\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Whoa! ...Oh, it's you. Sorry, friend, but I'm kinda busy right now. I don't have time to chew the fat.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Wait\f1\emdash\f0 you travel all over the world, right? Maybe you can help!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I know this is kinda outta the blue, but...could you track something down for me? I'll make it worth your while, I swear!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.\par
Will you acquiesce to this request?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Come on, you gotta throw me a bone here! The guys from the village can't find out about this! You're the only one I can rely on!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Mahalo, friend! Thank you so much! Alright, I'll cut to the chase\f1\emdash\f0 I need you to get my lucky lady back.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: She's a wooden figure in the shape of the goddess Lona. I take her with me every time I go fishing, but she's missing. I must have lost her on my last trip.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I definitely had her when I sailed up to that uninhabited island way off to the north of here. Guess maybe I dropped her there or something...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Which means you gotta sail up there and get her back! Oh, and don't tell the rest of the guys, alright?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Remember, I need you to bring my lucky lady back. She's a little wooden figure in the shape of the goddess Lona.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I've looked under every stone in the village, but I can't find her anywhere. I must have left her behind on my last fishing trip.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I definitely had her when I sailed up to that uninhabited island way off to the north of here. Guess I musta dropped her there.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Which means I need you to sail up there and bring her back. Oh, and don't tell the rest of the guys, alright?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You found the carved figure the fisherman was looking for! Head back to Lonalulu and reunite him with his lucky lady!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You're back! Well? Did you find her?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah, man... Well, don't give up yet! I gotta get my lucky lady back before the rest of the guys start asking questions!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Yeeeah! Lucky Lona, you came back to me! I'm never gonna let you go again!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, Lona... (sob) I've been so scared and sad since I lost you... I haven't felt that way since my ma passed away... (sniff)\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: ...Uhh, sorry you had to see that, friend. That ain't no way for a tough guy like me to be talking.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Truth is...I never told the guys this, but this figure was a present from my ma.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I may look like a stone-cold killer, but deep down, I guess I'm kind of a coward. I'm too scared to sail alone. But when I have Lucky Lona on board, it's like my ma's there with me.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: She has the same smile, you know. When the waves get big and I feel like I can't take no more, I look at Lona's face and it gives me the strength to carry on.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Mahalo, traveller. If you hadn't brought my lucky lady back, I'd have been too scared to ever set sail again. Here, I want you to have this.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Seriously, I've been a nervous wreck since I lost her. If my ma was still around, she would've chewed me out so bad...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: One of these days, I'm gonna grow myself a backbone and set sail into stormy waters without my lucky lady to keep me company!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I'm gonna do it, Ma... I'm gonna be a big, brave boy just like you always said! Till then, say you'll watch over me and keep me safe...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Huh!? H-How long have you been standing there!? Seriously, don't scare me like that! For a moment there, I thought my secret was out!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I was obsessed with humans around fifty years ago. When their ships sailed overhead, I'd watch them from below.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: One sailor was a singer, and he sang a sweet refrain. Oh, how I wish that I could hear that splendid song again...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Is hard to believe now, but when I am a boy, I have a voice like an angel. Il Piccolo Angelo, they call me!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The capitano of the biggest ship in Gondolia, he take me aboard to sing for the sailors. I travel everywhere! Is so much fun! Molto divertente!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Even the sea creatures come to hear me sing. One time I even see the face of una sirenetta\f1\emdash\f0 a real live mermaid!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I was obsessed with humans around fifty years ago. When their ships sailed overhead, I'd watch them from below.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: There was a certain trading ship which brought me so much joy, for in its crew there was a most delightful little boy.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: His tiny fingers tickled on a lyre's silver strings, and every day, from dawn to dusk, the darling boy would sing.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The songs he sang were nothing like the dirges of our nation. Those merry medleys moved me to a state of exaltation!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But after just a few short years, I heard his voice no more. Perhaps he left the crew and now he sings his songs ashore...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, how I wish to hear once more those heavenly refrains! Could you find him, friend, and beg that boy to sing again?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.\par
Will you acquiesce to this request?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Forgive me my presumption, it was rude of me to ask. I mustn't burden strangers with such trifling little tasks...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Thank you! Let me tell you all that I recall of him\f1\emdash\f0 it was so very long ago, my memories grow dim...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: His ship was brightly coloured\f1\emdash\f0 silver, gold, chartreuse and pink. A word was painted on the prow\f1\emdash\lquote\f0 Gondolia\rquote , I think...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Does that mean anything to you? Is it some sort of clue? Please find that boy again and have him sing his song anew!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Is hard to believe now, but when I am a boy, I have a voice like an angel. Il Piccolo Angelo, they call me!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The capitano of the biggest ship in Gondolia, he take me aboard to sing for the sailors. I travel everywhere! Is so much fun! Molto divertente!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Even the sea creatures come to hear me sing. One time I even see the face of una sirenetta\f1\emdash\f0 a real live mermaid!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you are thinking I am lying, go ask the mermaids...if you are a lucky enough man to find them! Yo ho ho!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: There's not much I remember of that sweet-voiced singing boy\f1\emdash\f0 most memories have ebbed away, but some still bring me joy.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: His ship was brightly coloured\f1\emdash\f0 silver, gold, chartreuse and pink. A word was painted on the prow\f1\emdash\lquote\f0 Gondolia\rquote , I think...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Does that mean anything to you? Is it some sort of clue? Please find that boy again and have him sing his song anew!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Is hard to believe now, but when I am a boy, I have a voice like an angel. Il Piccolo Angelo, they call me!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The capitano of the biggest ship in Gondolia, he take me aboard to sing for the sailors. I travel everywhere! Is so much fun! Molto divertente!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Even the sea creatures come to hear me sing. One time I even see the face of una sirenetta\f1\emdash\f0 a real live mermaid! If you no believe me, go ask her yourself!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell <pc> tells the old sailor about the mermaid in Nautica who wants to hear his song again.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Yo ho ho! Di certo, this is the mermaid I saw all those years ago! I am so happy that she remembers me! Sono felice!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I would very much like to sing for her again, but I am an old man now. My voice is not what it was...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But you\f1\emdash\f0 you are a healthy young ragazzo! You will not run out of breath so easily! If I teach you, will you sing to her my song? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Perdonami... Forgive me, ragazzo. I forget that some people do not like to sing as much as I once did...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Please tell to the mermaid that I am very sorry, but my singing days are over. Non si pu\'f2 fare niente\f1\emdash\f0 there is nothing that I can do.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Grazie mille! Thank you, traveller! Well then, if you are listening carefully, the song\f1\emdash\f0 it goes like this...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Farewell to thee, dear contest stage, goodbye, cake shop, goodbye, \f3\u9834?\f0\par
I'm bound for Octagonia, my humble wares to ply, \f3\u9834?\f0\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm bound for Octagonia, by way of Zwaardsrust town, \f3\u9834?\f0\par
I'll write to thee a letter, love, when I am homeward-bound, \f3\u9834?\f0\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: So fare thee well, when I return, united we will be, \f3\u9834?\f0\par
Leaving Gondolia's not what hurts, my love, it's leaving thee! \f3\u9834?\f0\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Yo ho ho! How long has it been since last I am singing this song? Now, is your turn, traveller\f1\emdash\f0 let the mermaid hear my shanty once again!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell The old sailor taught you his song! Go back to Nautica and sing it for the music-loving mermaid sitting in front of the Pearly Palace!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Welcome back to Nautica! You've been so very long. Did you find the minstrel boy? Did he sing you his song?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell <pc> tells the mermaid the old sailor's story, and sings the song that he taught him.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
Farewell to thee, dear contest stage, goodbye, cake shop, goodbye, \f3\u9834?\f0\par
I'm bound for Octagonia, my humble wares to ply, \f3\u9834?\f0\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
I'm bound for Octagonia, by way of Zwaardsrust town, \f3\u9834?\f0\par
I'll write to thee a letter, love, when I am homeward-bound, \f3\u9834?\f0\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
So fare thee well, when I return, united we will be, \f3\u9834?\f0\par
Leaving Gondolia's not what hurts, my love, it's leaving thee! \f3\u9834?\f0  \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: That's the one\f1\emdash\f0 the pretty little song that I adored! It seems like yesterday I heard him strum those sunny chords!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But now you say he's old and grey? Your lives go by so fast... You fill your songs with fire, for you know that fire won't last...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I feel that passion once again, and it's all thanks to you. Please take this, my friend\f1\emdash\f0 it is the least that I can do.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I stop singing when I leave the crew of the trading ship so many years ago. I do not think that anybody is remembering my songs.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My voice is not what it was, but still, is nice to sing from time to time. Thank you for reminding me, traveller!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now, ragazzo, is your turn to sing! Go back to that mermaid, and serenade her!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I cannot sing as sweetly as that boy, my friend, nor you\f1\emdash\f0 but if you'd like to hear his song, I'll see what I can do...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Farewell to thee, dear contest stage, goodbye, cake shop, goodbye, \f3\u9834?\f0\par
I'm bound for Octagonia, my humble wares to ply, \f3\u9834?\f0\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm bound for Octagonia, by way of Zwaardsrust town, \f3\u9834?\f0\par
I'll write to thee a letter, love, when I am homeward-bound, \f3\u9834?\f0\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: So fare thee well, when I return, united we will be, \f3\u9834?\f0\par
Leaving Gondolia's not what hurts, my love, it's leaving thee! \f3\u9834?\f0  \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I stop singing when I leave the crew of the trading ship so many years ago. I do not think that anybody is remembering my songs.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My voice is not what it was, but still, is nice to sing from time to time. Thank you for reminding me, traveller!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Sniflheim gets so very chilly at night. It makes one long for the warmth of another...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: (sigh) If only I had a wife, my bed would not be so cold... Or so lonely...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Do you know Krystalinda, traveller? She often drinks downstairs in the mead-hall. She is so very beautiful...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I fell in love with her at first sight. The other day, I finally plucked up the courage to ask for her hand in marriage.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I gave her a posy of flowers, and told her that I loved her more than words can say. That I would do anything for her!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And can you believe it, traveller\f1\emdash\f0 she said yes! She said that she would marry me...so long as I prove that I mean what I say...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: She says that there is a flower that only blooms by the inlet shaped like the full moon in the south of the Sn\'e6rfelt. If I am to win her hand, I must pluck one and bring it back to her.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But that place is infested with fierce and ferocious monsters! There is no way that I would be able to find it and return alive! (sigh) I do not know what to do...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Wait\f1\emdash\f0 traveller! You are a strong and stalwart warrior, yes? Will you brave the Sn\'e6rfelt and find it for me? I will make it worth your while!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.\par
Will you acquiesce to this request?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I see... Well, no matter. I will just have to ask somebody else...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You will!? Oh, thank you traveller! As I say, the flower I need blooms by the inlet shaped like the full moon in the south of the Sn\'e6rfelt\f1\emdash\f0 and only there.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Please pluck one and bring it back to me. My future happiness depends upon it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The flower that Krystalinda wants me to bring her blooms only by the inlet shaped like the full moon in the south of the Sn\'e6rfelt.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: As soon as you have found one, please bring it back to me. My future happiness is in your hands, traveller!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You found a Sn\'e6rose! Take it back to the young man in the mead-hall in Sniflheim!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, you are back. Tell me, traveller\f1\emdash\f0 have you found the flower I need to win Krystalinda's hand? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Then why have you returned? If ever I am to make her mine, I must have that flower! Please\f1\emdash\f0 do not disappoint me!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This is the flower you found by the moon-shaped lake? It is a Sn\'e6rose\f1\emdash\f0 a rare bloom that only grows amid the winter snow, and whose pure-white petals only open in the light of the moon.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now that I have it at last, Krystalinda will\f1\emdash\f0  ...Wait. A flower that never sees the summer? That never feels the warmth of the sun upon its face? This can mean only one thing:\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Unseasoned.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...I see now. This was not a task designed to prove my love\f1\emdash\f0 it was a message. She knew that I would not be able to find the flower myself.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: That I could not fulfil my true love's wish without relying on the aid of a stranger proves how unseasoned I am...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But my dream is not over yet! When I am strong enough to brave the Sn\'e6rfelt and find the flower myself, she will surely reconsider!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Thank you, traveller. You have opened my eyes. You have shown me that I am not yet worthy of Krystalinda's love. Please, take this. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, it is you again. Since last we met, I have been training myself in body and spirit, but it is more difficult than I first thought...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I will not give up, though\f1\emdash\f0 I will become strong enough to win Krystalinda's hand, and her heart too! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The Vikings who live in the far western reaches of Sniflheim are rough and rowdy fellows, but they are good people at heart.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: They honour the royal family with rare and exotic treasures from all over Erdrea, and the kingdom offers them a certain level of financial assistance in return.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I hope he is alright... No, I am sure he is! He is a Viking! He would not offer himself up to the crows so easily...would he?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Away with you, world-walker! I am fishing for a tribute fit for a queen!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The Vikings who live in the far western reaches of Sniflheim are rough and rowdy fellows, but they are good people at heart.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: They honour the royal family with rare and exotic treasures from all over Erdrea, and the kingdom offers them a certain level of financial assistance in return.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I serve as the Minister for Viking Affairs, ensuring that relations between our two societies run smoothly. Alas, all has not been smooth of late...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Days have passed since the Vikings were due to deliver their latest shipment of tributes, but they have not yet shown their faces.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: They are usually such sticklers for punctuality. I do hope nothing untoward has happened to them... Ah, but I cannot go to check on them myself\f1\emdash\f0 what if they were to arrive when I was away?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You look as if you are at a loose end, my friend. Would you help me find out what has become of our missing Viking friends and their overdue tributes?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.\par
Will you acquiesce to this request?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: (sigh) Very well... But if Her Majesty does not receive her gifts soon, she will be most upset. I do hope that she does not shut herself in her room again...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The last time this happened, her wailing kept the whole of Sniflheim awake for a week!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Thank you, friend. If Her Majesty does not receive her gifts soon, I fear she will shut herself in her room again...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The Viking hideout is just to the west of Sniflheim. It is a very short journey by ship.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Please go to them and ask what is delaying their delivery. If you can recover the missing tributes, I will reward you most handsomely! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The Vikings should have delivered their latest batch of tributes by now. This delay is causing me no end of worry. I want you to find them and bring them here.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The Vikings' hideout is just around the coast to the west. It is a very short journey by ship.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Please let me know as soon as you have located the missing gifts. I will ensure that you are rewarded most handsomely!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hello again, my friend! Well\f1\emdash\f0 did you speak with the Vikings?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...What!? The man who was sent to collect the tribute for Her Majesty has gone missing!?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh dear... Oh dear, oh dear... If she does not receive her gift soon, I fear Queen Frysabel will shut herself in her room again...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Please, my friend\f1\emdash\f0 you must find this missing Viking and bring back the tribute as soon as you can!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: What do you want, world-walker?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...So, that busybody minister sent you to chase up the missing tribute, did he?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Sorry, but you've made a wasted journey. The truth is, my little brother was the one who went to collect it, but he's gone missing.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We have had all the longboats out looking for him\f1\emdash\f0 that's why we weren't able to send word to your friend.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: However, we have had no luck in finding him so far. Every boat that has sailed into the northern seas to try to find him has been driven back by savage sea monsters.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You have a sailing ship of your own, yes? If you should bump into my brother on your travels, will you tell him we are looking for him?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He sailed to the island north of Yggdrasil. I am sure he is still around there somewhere.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Please, world-walker. He is my only brother. If you see him, tell him to come home.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you should bump into my brother on your travels, will you tell him we are looking for him? I am sure he is still alive. He would not give himself up to the crows so easily.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He sailed to the island north of Yggdrasil. He must still be around there somewhere.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Please, world-walker. He is my only brother. If you see him, tell him to come home.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: What do you want, world-walker? I am busy finding a tribute fit for a queen. I do not have time to talk to strangers.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: S\'e6ll, world-walker! I am a Viking, and I hail from snowy Sniflheim. I have come here to find a present for Her Majesty the Queen!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...What? My brother sent you to tell me to come home right away? Ha ha ha! He is such a worryguts!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Yes, my ship may have sunk, but apart from that, I am perfectly fine!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Indeed, I am better than fine! The seas around this island are absolutely teeming with Queen Frysabel's favourite food\f1\emdash\f0 scruffy urchins!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: They may look a little tatty, but they taste incredible! I have just found the biggest, juiciest specimen I have ever seen\f1\emdash\f0 it will make a perfect present for Her Majesty!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I just have to sail back to Sniflheim, and\f1\emdash\f0  ...Ah. Now I see the problem. Would you take this back to Sniflheim for me?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I will stay here and fish for more scruffy urchins to grace the dining table of the Queen. May the wind be at your back, friend! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell <pc> receives a scruffy urchin! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You found Queen Frysabel's missing tribute! Return to the item shop in Sniflheim and hand it to the Minister for Viking Affairs! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, you have returned. Well\f1\emdash\f0 did you speak with the Vikings?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Wait a moment\f1\emdash\f0 what is that in your hand? Is that Her Majesty's favourite foodstuff\f1\emdash\f0 a scruffy urchin!?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I do not know why you have such a thing, but you must give it to me! This will make a perfect present for Queen Frysabel! Well? Can I have it? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You will not part with it? Oh dear... If I do not deliver her tribute soon, I fear we will never see Her Majesty's sunny smile again. Please, I beg you to reconsider. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: That black, glossy body! Those higgledy-piggledy spines! This is the finest example of a scruffy urchin I have ever seen! It will make a perfect present for Her Majesty!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Thank you, traveller. If she were denied her tribute, Queen Frysabel would surely pull her hair and stomp her feet, and shut herself in her room for three days and three nights at least!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But now this crisis is averted, and it is all thanks to you! Here. I hope this goes some way to expressing the true depth of my gratitude. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: S\'e6ll, world-walker. What news of my brother?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...I see. He was shipwrecked and washed up on a desert island, but instead of seeking help, he has spent his time fishing for urchins for Queen Frysabel?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ha ha ha! That is my brother, alright! He would not let a little thing like a shipwreck get him down! I was a fool to worry about him!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Thank you for your help, world-walker. You have put my heart at ease.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Go take that scruffy urchin back to Sniflheim and give it to the Minister for Viking Affairs.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm going to stay here a little longer and try to catch an even bigger one to put on Queen Frysabel's plate! Good luck, world-walker! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now that you have brought us the scruffy urchin, our little Viking problem is solved.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I cannot thank you enough, traveller. You have my undying gratitude. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You gave the scruffy urchin to the Minister? Thanks, world-walker.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm going to stay here a little longer and try to catch some more\f1\emdash\f0 then I'll load them into the longboat and be back for supper! Oh, wait... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm...rather poorly. The doctor said that he doesn't know how to make me better. But I think I might know a way...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My grandfather once told me about a magical flower called a wishteria. He said that when they bloom, they grant a single wish.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you're ever planning on a trip to the First Forest, could you let me know? You might be my only hope...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm...rather poorly. The doctor said that he doesn't know how to make me better. But I think I might know a way...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My grandfather once told me about a magical flower called a wishteria. He said that when they bloom, they grant a single wish.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But their seeds are very difficult to get hold of. The only way to obtain them is to track down a very rare monster called a wight bulb and defeat it in battle.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You and your friends look very strong. Could you defeat one for me and bring me back some wishteria seeds? It might be my only hope! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.\par
Will you acquiesce to this request?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Sorry... I know it's a lot to ask of a perfect stranger. Please, forget that I said anything... (cough cough cough) \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, thank you! If I can just get my hands on some of those seeds, I'll be able to wish for them to make me well again when the flowers finally bloom!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The wight bulbs that carry them live in the First Forest, but they only appear very rarely.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You should try fighting their friends, the sprite bulbs. \lquote Fight a sprite, and a wight might bite!\rquote  That's what my grandfather always told me!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It won't be easy to find, but I'm counting on you. After all, you're my only hope. Please, bring me back the seeds I need to make me better... (cough cough) \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When I have my very own wishteria seeds, I'll wish for them to make me well again when the flowers finally bloom!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The wight bulbs that carry them live in the First Forest, but they only appear very rarely.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You should try fighting their friends, the sprite bulbs. \lquote Fight a sprite, and a wight might bite!\rquote  That's what my grandfather always told me!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It won't be easy to find, but I'm counting on you. After all, you're my only hope. Please, bring me back the seeds I need to make me better... (cough cough) \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You found a bag of wishteria seeds! Take it to the grove north of Arboria and give it to the poorly girl!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Did you find the wishteria seeds I asked you to look for? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: That's alright... I'll just wait here until you find some... (cough cough) \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hooray! You kept your promise! Thank you so much!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My grandfather told me that the bigger the wish that you ask of the seeds, the prettier the flowers will be when they finally bloom.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I wonder if my wishterias will be pretty... Actually, I don't have to wonder\f1\emdash\f0 I just have to wish and wait, and some day soon I'll see for myself!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Thanks to you, I can dream of the future again. Here\f1\emdash\f0 I want you to have this. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: (cough cough cough cough) My cough seems to be getting worse... But don't worry about me\f1\emdash\f0 when my wishterias bloom, I'll be back to my old self again!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I can't wait to see them... I wish they would hurry up... When they do finally appear, you'll come back to have a look too, won't you? (cough cough) \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ho ho ho! You are not feeling under the weather, I trust? You must take care of yourself, my boy! There can be no greater pleasure in life than to tend to one's own health!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Indeed, you seem to be in fine fettle. If you should ever plan to pop to the First Forest, pray speak with me before you go. I might know of a way to make that fettle of yours even finer!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ho ho ho! You are not feeling under the weather, I trust? You must take care of yourself, my boy! There can be no greater pleasure in life than to tend to one's own health!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But the path to true fitness is an arduous one indeed! One must sacrifice one's heart and soul upon the altar of wellness!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I have devoted my entire life to the pursuit of true salubrity, and after years of painstaking research, I have finally found the secret! I call it...Super Soup!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Or at least, I will when it is completed at last. Young man, will you lend me your aid in concocting this miraculous broth? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.\par
Will you acquiesce to this request?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: What!? You have no interest in the ways of wellness!?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I find your way of thinking unfathomable! If your health matters so little to you, by what miracle are you still alive!? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ho ho ho! I knew that you would say yes! Now, what I need you to do is to head deep into the First Forest and bring me back a single leaf of the most vital ingredient of all\f1\emdash\f0 red kale!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The First Forest is a sacred place, into which none may set foot without the High Priest's permission\f1\emdash\f0 but you are the Luminary! How could he possibly refuse you?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Remember, my boy\f1\emdash\f0 a single leaf of red kale is all that I require. May the spirits of salubriousness go with you, my fellow fitness fanatic! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I need you to head deep into the First Forest and bring me back the vital ingredient for my miraculous Super Soup\f1\emdash\f0 red kale!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: A single leaf is all that I require. May the spirits of salubriousness go with you, my fellow fitness fanatic!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You found a leaf of red kale! Return to Arboria and give it to the fitness fanatic near the cathedral! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My boy, you have returned! Tell me, did you find the red kale? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Forgive me, but I would be most grateful if you could find it sooner rather than later. This anxious anticipation is not good for my health-loving heart! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This is it! The vital ingredient! I have merely to add it to my Super Soup, and the recipe will at last be complete! I will prepare it immediately... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: (gulp gulp gulp)\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Yeurgh! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: That is DISGUSTING! I have never tasted anything quite so foul in all my life! But wait... I can feel it... It is working!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: HOOHOOOOOO! I am bursting with energy! It is as if the life force of the First Forest\f1\emdash\f0 no, of the World Tree Herself!\f1\emdash\f0 is surging through my every sinew!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You are a true servant of salubrity, my young friend! Take this\f1\emdash\f0 may it bring you happiness, but more importantly\f1\emdash\f0 health! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well met, my young friend! The Super Soup you aided me in perfecting has ushered me to a plane of wellness beyond my wildest dreams!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But my journey is not over yet! I must put my new-found fitness to good use in the pursuit of an even more vigorous vitality! Ho ho ho ho ho! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Whether one emerges from battle in triumph or defeat depends not on one's skill with a sword or one's magical might, but upon one's will to win.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: No matter how powerful one's opponent, one must clear one's mind of all doubt, and devote oneself entirely to overcoming the challenge they present.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This is the first teaching of Angri-La. We disciples train day after day to master this mindset. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
