\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This skill vastly increases one's attacking might at the expense of defence. It encourages one to eliminate all thoughts of defeat from one's mind, and concentrate entirely on the offensive. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You defeated a boreal serpent after using Blaze of Glory! Report back to the martial arts instructor standing near the church in Angri-La! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My congratulations. I know that you have passed the trial\f1\emdash\f0 the aura of triumph flows from your every chakra.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You have seen the true power of the first teaching of Angri-La. Summon that same spirit on the battlefield, and none shall stand in your path.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Though this enlightenment is its own reward, please allow me to add a small token of my own congratulation. May it serve you well in the battles to come. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Not all have been as successful as you in passing this trial. Many years ago, a disciple named Robert attempted it, but fled at the first sight of the serpent.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Some say that it was not fear that made him flee, but that he purposefully failed the trial in order to earn the Grand Master's ire. Truly, he was a glutton for punishment...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I pray that you do not develop similar...proclivities. The training that our disciples undergo here may be harsh, but only by overcoming such trials can one hope to find enlightenment. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Not all have been as successful as you in passing the Trial of the Serpent. Many years ago, a disciple named Robert attempted it, but fled at the first sight of the monster.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Some say that it was not fear that made him flee, but that he purposefully failed the trial in order to earn the Grand Master's ire. Truly, he was a glutton for punishment...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I pray that you do not develop similar...proclivities. The training that our disciples undergo here may be harsh, but only by overcoming such trials can one hope to find enlightenment. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Fear not, traveller! I plan to put my training to good use, and protect all who seek shelter here from danger!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If the worst should come to pass, I shall lay my very life on the line! My steely physique shall shield this temple from attack! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I have been hard at work honing my physique, so that it might serve as a shield to protect all who seek shelter here from danger.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My brawny body is stronger than a slab of stainless steel! A liquid metal slime has nothing on me!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My mighty muscles are so strong that no normal weapon could even mark them!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Do you not believe me, traveller? Do you think that you can build a blade sharp enough to cut through my steely physique? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.\par
Will you acquiesce to this request?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I thought not. There is not a weapon in the world my body could not break! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ha ha ha ha ha! I admire your confidence! Alright then\f1\emdash\f0 show me what you can do!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But you should know that my victory is already assured. Why, you ask? Because I know for a fact that the only weapon capable of harming my iron-hard body is a legate's blade with a power of +3!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Such a sword can only be crafted with a Fun-Size Forge\f1\emdash\f0 that most mystical of smithing stands\f1\emdash\f0 and only then by a true master of metallurgy.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Not only that, but the recipe is a closely guarded secret of Angri-La. It is only awarded to those bold enough to test themselves against the Wheel of Harma, and strong enough to conquer its every cycle!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you should succeed in crafting a legate's blade with a power of +3, then equip it and come and show me. I have always wanted to witness a miracle! Ha ha ha ha ha! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My burly body is impervious to any sword under the sun, save a legate's blade with a power of +3. And such a sword can only be crafted with a Fun-Size Forge.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The recipe is a closely guarded secret of Angri-La. It is only awarded to those bold enough to test themselves against the Wheel of Harma, and strong enough to conquer its every cycle!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you should succeed in crafting a legate's blade with a power of +3, then equip it and come and show me. I have always wanted to witness a miracle! Ha ha ha ha ha! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: C-C-Can it truly be!? The sword that you hold in your hand\f1\emdash\f0 is it a legate's blade? And with a power of +3, no less!?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I... I underestimated you! Never in my wildest dreams did I believe that you would be able to craft such a weapon!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Even my mighty muscles could not withstand a critical hit from such a blade! It would cleave me in twain...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And if an evildoer were to wield such a weapon, I would be powerless to shield those seeking shelter here from their attacks... Angri-La would fall...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh871\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I see now that no shield is truly unbreakable... One cannot rely on defensive strength alone. I must learn how to put these muscles of mine to use!\par
*: Thank you, traveller, for showing me the light. Please, take these\f1\emdash\f0 I thought them worthless, but now I see how precious they really are! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I was wrong to think that mighty muscles were all I needed to protect this place. I have confessed my error to the High Lama, and in his infinite wisdom, he has forgiven me.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I thank you again, traveller, for showing me the light. From now on, I shall devote myself not only to building my strength, but my martial prowess also.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I will never forget what you have done for me. You have opened my eyes to the true path! I swear that I will make the most of the wisdom you have given me! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: A knight's word is his bond, his kingdom his master! He serves the weak untiringly, challenges the strong unflinchingly and never retreats in the face of adversity!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You have heard of the Knight's Pledge, s\'ed? It is a set of rules that all caballeros\f1\emdash\f0 and aspiring caballeros\f1\emdash\f0 must live by. We must all commit it to memory.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Por favor, amigo... Please listen to this tale of woe. A monster known as the knight aberrant is haunting the Eerie Eyrie.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He was once a noble caballero, but was somehow transformed into a monster. His sense of knightliness has disappeared completely, and he commits the most wicked acts. \'a1Es terrible!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Someone must put an end to the evil ways of this disgrace to chivalry and restore the reputation of caballeros everywhere!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It will not be easy, of course, but there is a certain pep power that I am sure could be used to put him in his place.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You appear to have something of the caballero about you, friend. Would you be willing to confront this so-called knight and smite him in the name of justice?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.\par
Will you acquiesce to this request?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ay... Very well. I understand. Let me know if you should change your mind, s\'ed?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Muchas gracias, friend! Now, the pep power that you will need to use to put this knight aberrant in his place is called Arise!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It must be performed by three able swordsmen. Bring two such warriors with you to the Eerie Eyrie and unleash merry hell! \'a1Vamos, amigo!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You must make the knight aberrant pay the price for breaking the promises of the Pledge!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
