\pard\intbl Rose\cell And now you've appeared, and you can see me and everything! It must have been Yggdrasil's will that brought you here.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Rose\cell Would you be able to make my final wish come true so I can finally be free? You'll do that for me, won't you? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
