\pard\intbl Rose\cell My deepest, most heartfelt wish is to find the treasure left behind by l'Acad\'e9mie's most prolific medal-hunter ever: Maxie van Bloem!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Rose\cell I don't know what this treasure is, but apparently it glitters like the setting sun on the ocean waves, and it's more precious than the purest gold.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
