\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell This is Maxie's true treasure\f1\emdash\f0 the scenery of her homeland of Zwaardsrust! Return to l'Acad\'e9mie de Notre Ma\'eetre des M\'e9dailles and tell Rose what you've learned! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
