\pard\intbl\cell <pc> takes a long look around, absorbing the bucolic beauty of fields of golden wheat glittering like the setting sun on the ocean waves. It's quite a breathtaking sight. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Welcome to l'Acad\'e9mie. I am Madame Augustine, and I 'ave been a teacher 'ere for forty years. I cannot count ze number of young girls zat 'ave passed through zese 'allowed 'alls.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme Augustine\cell So many 'appy days... I thought zat zey would last forever... But my old bones, zey are beginning to creak\f1\emdash\f0 it will soon be time for me to leave zis place too... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hello, mister! My name is Lili! When I grow up, I am going to go to school and learn about everything!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Lili\cell It is the same school that my mamma's mamma went to when she was a little girl. They say it has a garden with lots and lots of pretty flowers! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Welcome to l'Acad\'e9mie. I am Madame Augustine, and I 'ave been a teacher 'ere for forty years. I cannot count ze number of young girls zat 'ave passed through zese 'allowed 'alls.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme Augustine\cell I remember one girl en particulier 'oo caused me more 'eadaches zan all of ze others put together...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme Augustine\cell She was a naughty jeune fille 'oo was always getting 'erself into mischief!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme Augustine\cell But no matter 'ow much trouble she caused, you could not 'elp but smile at 'er antics! She was ze breath of fresh air zat messes up your 'air!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme Augustine\cell But zen, one cold and frosty winter morning, just a few days before 'er graduation, she ran away. She sent a letter a few days later saying she would not be coming back\f1\emdash\f0 et voil\'e0, she never did.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme Augustine\cell Zat was thirty years ago... I am an old woman now. Soon I will leave zis place too.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme Augustine\cell But before I go, I want 'er to 'ave 'er dipl\'f4me\f1\emdash\f0 ze certificate I would 'ave given 'er on 'er graduation day. Only when zat is done can I retire sans regrets.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme Augustine\cell Can you 'elp me, mon cher? Can you find zis girl and give 'er ze dipl\'f4me I 'ave been 'olding onto all zese years? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.\par
Will you acquiesce to this request?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme Augustine\cell Per'aps you are right... It all 'appened so very long ago. 'Ow would you ever even find 'er? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme Augustine\cell Merci beaucoup! If you could find 'er, I would be so very grateful! Ze only clue I 'ave to 'er location is ze letter she sent after she ran away.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme Augustine\cell Ze postmark shows zat it was sent from ze Crystal Kingdom of Sniflheim.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme Augustine\cell Per'aps if you were to go zere, ze locals might be able to give you some kind of clue as to 'er whereabouts.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme Augustine\cell 'Er name is Liliane. Please, you must go to Sniflheim, find 'er and deliver ze dipl\'f4me! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell <pc> receives the Dipl\'f4me de l'Acad\'e9mie! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme Augustine\cell I cannot 'elp but wonder what 'appened to ze 'ot-'eaded jeune fille who ran away a few days before 'er graduation.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme Augustine\cell She sent a letter to tell us zat she would not be coming back.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme Augustine\cell Ze postmark on ze envelope shows zat it was sent from ze Crystal Kingdom of Sniflheim.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme Augustine\cell Per'aps if you were to go zere, ze locals might be able to give you some kind of clue as to 'er whereabouts.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme Augustine\cell 'Er name is Liliane. Please, you must go to Sniflheim, find 'er and deliver ze dipl\'f4me! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: What's that, mister? You're looking for a lady called Liliane? Well, my name is Lili\f1\emdash\f0 is that close enough?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Lili\cell Tee hee! I'm only joking. I know exactly who it is that you're looking for.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Lili\cell Liliane is the name of my mamma's mamma. Are you a friend of hers? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell Give Liliane's diploma to Lili? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Lili\cell Hmm... Maybe there is more than one Liliane, then. I hope you find your friend, mister. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Lili\cell Is it a letter for my grandmamma? ...I'm sorry, mister, but she will not be able to read it.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Lili\cell She... She isn't here any more, you see... She went to see the World Tree. I, I mean, she...passed away...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Lili\cell Her story was a very sad one. She came from Zwaardsrust, you see. One day, not long before she would have graduated, it was destroyed by the monsters. They hurt her mummy and daddy and stole all their money.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Lili\cell She had to leave the school she loved and start working so that she could pay the doctors who were trying to make her mummy and daddy better.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Lili\cell Because of what she went through, she always wanted me to study very hard so that I could one day go to the school she loved so much and learn to be a lady.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Lili\cell So that's what I am going to do\f1\emdash\f0 when I am older, I'm going to go to l'Acad\'e9mie de Notre Ma\'eetre des M\'e9dailles.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Lili\cell I will finish the studies that my grandmamma never managed to, and make her happy up in heaven!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Lili\cell ...But just listen to me, going on and on. You don't want to hear my troubles. You just want to deliver your letter, I am sure.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Lili\cell Well, I cannot give it to her exactly, but I can put it on her grave the next time I go to see her. I'm sure she'd like that! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You gave Liliane's diploma to her grandaughter Lili. You should head back to l'Acad\'e9mie de Notre Ma\'eetre des M\'e9dailles and tell Madame Augustine what you found out. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme Augustine\cell 'Allo again, mon cher. Did you 'ave any luck in finding Liliane and giving 'er ze dipl\'f4me?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell <pc> tells Madame Augustine that Liliane has passed away, but that he was able to give her diploma to her grandaughter Lili instead.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme Augustine\cell Oh... Is zat so... I was too late, zen...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme Augustine\cell I remember ze people of Zwaardsrust were scattered far and wide after ze kingdom fell. Many could not find ze strength to carry on.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme Augustine\cell But Liliane was always dure \'e0 cuire\f1\emdash\f0 'ow you say...a real tough cookie. She did what she 'ad to do to make sure 'er family pulled through.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme Augustine\cell Merci, mon cher. Thank you for delivering the dipl\'f4me. Now, I can finally retire sans regrets.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme Augustine\cell 'Ere, I want you to take zis. It is only une petite chose\f1\emdash\f0 a little thing\f1\emdash\f0 but I 'ope zat it 'elps you on your way. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Lili\cell My grandmamma told me that there was a very, very scary teacher at her school called Madame Augustine.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Lili\cell Every time Grandmamma played one of her funny jokes, Madame Augustine would turn bright red and chase her around the classroom with a ruler!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Lili\cell The strange thing is, whenever my grandmamma told me scary stories about her, she always had a big smile on her face. She was a funny lady... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme Augustine\cell I thought that I might retire soon, but if Liliane's grandaughter is to come 'ere, per'aps I will stay a little longer.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme Augustine\cell You said zat 'er name was Lili, est-ce correct? Just like 'er grand-m\'e8re... I only 'ope zat she does not 'ave ze same penchant for mischief! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Yes? Do not stare at me comme \'e7a. I believe ze words you are searching for are \lquote Bonjour, Madame Labouche!\rquote\par
*: Honn\'eatement, I do not know what Monsieur M\'e9daill\'e9 is thinking, allowing such an in\'e9l\'e9gant young man to wander around l'Acad\'e9mie willy-nilly!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme Labouche\cell Ze girls 'oo attend zis honourable \'e9cole will one day be ze shining stars of Erdrean haute soci\'e9t\'e9. Zey should not be mixing with riff-raff!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme Labouche\cell As 'ead of ze deportment department, it is my duty to ensure zat all 'oo come here leave with ze required standard of \'e9l\'e9gance et politesse\f1\emdash\f0 and zat includes you! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I am Madame Labouche. I 'ave been watching you since you first set foot on Acad\'e9mie grounds. I 'ave 'eld my tongue until now, but I can 'old it no more!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme Labouche\cell 'Ow dare you traipse around zis honourable \'e9cole comme un vagabond!? Zese girls will one day be ze shining stars of Erdrean haute soci\'e9t\'e9. Zey should not be mixing with riff-raff!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme Labouche\cell And you, mon petit filou, are ze riffiest, raffiest ruffian I 'ave ever 'ad ze d\'e9plaisir to witness wandering zese 'allowed grounds!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme Labouche\cell But zere is 'ope for you yet. If you wish to prove zat you are indeed un gentilhomme worthy of zis Acad\'e9mie, you must dress to impress\f1\emdash\f0 me, zat is!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme Labouche\cell Come back when you are looking a little more chic et choc\f1\emdash\f0 smart and stylish\f1\emdash\f0 and I will see if you measure up to my exacting standards! Do we 'ave an accord? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.\par
Will you acquiesce to this request?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme Labouche\cell Quel l\'e2che! What a coward you are! Afraid zat you will not make ze grade, hein? Le style is not something you are born with, it is something you must work hard to achieve!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme Labouche\cell So get to work! Qui n'avance pas, recule\f1\emdash\f0 if you do not try, you will never succeed! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme Labouche\cell Une bonne r\'e9ponse! Zat's ze spirit, filou! Now, zere are several ways to boost your style: first and foremost, you must gain experience and take your statistiques vital to another level.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme Labouche\cell But zat alone will not suffice! Un gentilhomme must ensure zat 'is entire ensemble exudes \'e9l\'e9gance.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme Labouche\cell Les armes, les accessoires... Every single thing that you equip affects 'ow stylish you appear. Pick out ze \'e9quipement zat shows you off to your best avantage!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme Labouche\cell Bonne chance, filou\f1\emdash\f0 good luck! Come back to me when you 'ave made a true Prince Charmant of yourself! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme Labouche\cell Ah, you 'ave returned. But 'ave you grown \'e9l\'e9gant enough to measure up to my exacting standards yet?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme Labouche\cell Let me 'ave a look at you...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme Labouche\cell Hmmm... Hm hm hm... Hmmmmmmmmm...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme Labouche\cell ...Non, non, non, non, non! Zis will not do at all! You look about as \'e9l\'e9gant as ze backside of a bunicorn!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme Labouche\cell Listen to me, filou\f1\emdash\f0 if you wish to improve your style, you must improve yourself! Gain experience and take your statistiques vital to another level!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme Labouche\cell But zat alone will not suffice! Un gentilhomme must ensure zat 'is entire ensemble exudes \'e9l\'e9gance.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme Labouche\cell Les armes, les accessoires... Every single thing that you equip affects 'ow stylish you appear. Pick out ze \'e9quipement zat shows you off to your best avantage!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mme Labouche\cell Bonne chance, filou\f1\emdash\f0 good luck! Come back to me when you 'ave made a true Prince Charmant of yourself! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
