\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This bathhouse is rather a hot topic among the cognoscenti of Heliodor. It is famed for its marvellous effect on wrinkly skin, you see.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I must confess, the rather...basic nature of the facilities shocked me somewhat at first, but still, I am very much looking forward to enjoying its youth-giving benefits.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I came all the way from Heliodor to sample the waters here and enjoy their supposed wrinkle-reducing properties, but I must confess, the experience left me rather cold\f1\emdash\f0 literally!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If I want to look twenty years younger, I am going to need veritable clouds of piping hot steam, not this dreadful, lukewarm excuse for a sauna!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I spoke to the fellow who runs the place, and he said something about them having used a substance called fiery brimstone to heat the water in the past, but that it had become rather difficult to find of late.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I say, you look like a nice, kind young man. There's something about the sheen of your hair that I instinctively trust... I wonder if you might do me an enormous favour and seek out some of this fiery brimstone?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.\par
Will you acquiesce to this request?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: How very dare you! Where is your sense of decency!? Of decorum!? When a lady asks you to jump, you must ask \lquote how high?\rquote  Did they teach you nothing at school? Honestly!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ho ho! I knew you were a fine young man who would never refuse a request from a damsel in distress!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Apparently, this brimstone substance can only be obtained by defeating a monster known as a lava lampling.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: According to the owner of this tepid bathhouse, they can be found on Mount Huji. He couldn't be more precise than that, so I suppose you'll just have to have a jolly good look round.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now, there's no time for dawdling! Find that fiery brimstone so that we can heat the water here properly and build up the head of steam I need to make my wrinkles vanish!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This bathhouse is famed for its youth-giving properties among the chattering classes of Heliodor, but I must confess that it left me rather cold\f1\emdash\f0 literally!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If I am to have the clouds of steam I need to soothe away my wrinkles, I shall require a substance known as fiery brimstone.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Apparently, the only way to obtain it is to defeat a monster known as a lava lampling. They live somewhere on Mount Huji, apparently.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You got hold of some fiery brimstone! Take it to the woman waiting by the bathhouse in Hotto!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Good day to you, young man. I trust you have defeated a lava lampling and brought me the fiery brimstone I require for my beauty regime?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: What!? Not yet, you say? Well, what are you waiting for? I cannot wait here forever\f1\emdash\f0 I have wrinkles I need to get rid of! Now hop to it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You have? How marvellous! With this wonderful substance, I shall have all the clouds of piping hot steam I'll need to rid myself of wrinkles forever!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Of course, I didn't just do this for myself! No, I want everyone to be able to partake of the gift I am so generously bestowing upon this unfortunate little establishment!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: No doubt they will one day build a statue here in my honour\f1\emdash\f0 that's the very least they owe me!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now, speaking of my selflessness and boundless generosity, here is a small reward for the minor role you played in my latest philanthropic enterprise...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I simply cannot wait to make use of this marvellous fiery brimstone and enjoy the silky-smooth skin of my youth again! Thank you so much for bringing it to me, you dear, sweet boy!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You won't believe this, but the wretched owner of this rotten bathhouse has forbidden me from using the fiery brimstone you brought me!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He told me that I risked burning the whole place to the ground, and that I was banned for life! The cheek!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Does he not realise that I have wrinkles that require treatment!? Is that not more important than whether or not his wretched shack burns down!? Honestly, some people are completely and utterly misguided!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Perch\'e9...? Why he die...? Why he leave me...?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My lover... (sniff) He die on the day that Yggdrasil fall down... Before this day, he is an healthy man... An happy man...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But they say that every leaf of Yggdrasil is the life of one person, s\'ec? Maybe his leaf is destroyed, and he lose his life because of this...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: (sniff) Before he die, he tell me he bring me a special flower... One that grow in the desert of Gallopolis... He say he give me this as the engagement present... (sniff) Oh, povero me...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But... But still I want to see this flower... I want to see what my lover wished to give to me... Maybe it can bring me a little bit of comfort, s\'ec?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Can you help me, per favore? Can you go into the desert of Gallopolis and find for me this flower?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: That day, everything change, s\'ec? The monsters, they become molto, molto vizioso... And my lover, he is killed...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: (sniff) Before he die, he tell me he bring me a special flower... One that grow in the desert of Gallopolis... He say he give me this as the engagement present... (sniff) Oh, povero me...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But... But still I want to see this flower... I want to see what my lover wished to give to me... Maybe it can bring me a little bit of comfort, s\'ec?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Can you help me, per favore? Can you go into the desert of Gallopolis and find for me this flower?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.\par
Will you acquiesce to this request?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah, scusa, scusa... Forgive me\f1\emdash\f0 is very rude of me to make this request to a stranger. You forget about me, per favore...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Is okay, signore. Really, is okay. I find another way...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: G-Grazie... Grazie mille... You have a cuore d'oro\f1\emdash\f0 an heart of gold, s\'ec? Allora, I tell you all I know about this special flower.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My lover, he say the name of the flower is the desert rose. Is hard to believe the rose can grow in the desert, s\'ec? But my lover never lie. Never.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This desert rose exist, signore. Per favore, you must search the sands of Gallopolis! Every grain of them, if is necessary!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When you find it, signore, bring it to me. I wait here for you, s\'ec?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Before he die, my lover tell me that he bring me a special flower from the desert of Gallopolis. I want to see this flower, signore. Maybe it bring me a little bit of comfort in my grieving, s\'ec?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My lover, he say the name of the flower is the desert rose. Is hard to believe the rose can grow in the desert, s\'ec? But my lover never lie. Never.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This desert rose exist, signore. Per favore, you must search the sands of Gallopolis! Every grain of them, if is necessary!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When you find it, signore, bring it to me. I wait here for you, s\'ec?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You found a desert rose. You should take it to the grieving woman in the eastern part of Gondolia.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Ciao, signore. ...Hm? Could it be? You find my desert rose?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Ahim\'e8... Is okay, I understand... The desert rose, is not so easy to find, I suppose...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Per favore, signore\f1\emdash\f0 you cannot put yourself in danger because of me. If you die, you make someone very, very sad, s\'ec? Molto, molto triste...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Hm? You have brought it for me? Santo cielo... Is made of crystals! Ahh, Madre Natura\f1\emdash\f0 Mother Nature\f1\emdash\f0 she create so many miracles!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: At last I have seen what my lover wanted to give me... Is... Is beautiful! Bellissimo! And also, is a symbol, s\'ec? A symbol of how life always emerge and prevail.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Is strange, signore... When I look at this flower, I think I can hear the voice of my lover, speaking to me... He tell me to enjoy my life...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: S\'ec... He is correct, no? This world, it is full of miracles. I must enjoy them as much as I can. Then perhaps I tell my lover of them when we are reunited at last.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Grazie mille, signore. I feel much stronger now. Molto pi\'f9 forte! Prego. Take this, per favore. Is not so much, but I want you to have it.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The desert rose bring back many happy memories for me.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You no need to worry about me any more, signore. I never forget my lover. Always he exist somewhere inside of me.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I must say grazie mille once again to you. Thank you, s\'ec? I pray that your journey is safe and successful. Buon viaggio, signore!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ciao, ragazzo! You are an adventurer, s\'ec? Aha ha ha! S\'ec, I can see it in your face\f1\emdash\f0 is so full of curiosity and ambition! Is like looking at my face when I am young!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ahh, there is nothing better than adventure! Grande avventura! You must enjoy as many adventures as you can while you are young, that is my advice!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ahh, la brezza marina! Every time I stand here and smell the sea breeze, I remember the adventures I have when I am young...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I was un capitano, s\'ec? The captain of a ship! Every day, me and my crew, we sail the ocean and look for the treasure. We find a lot, but one day, we find something very, very special indeed!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The name is the sage's stone. Santo cielo... Still I remember the moment I see it for the first time!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But alas, ragazzo, this not a story with an happy ending... When we sail back to Gondolia with all our treasure, there is a terrible storm\f1\emdash\f0 una tempesta molto terribile\f1\emdash\f0 our ship, it is wrecked upon the rocks...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Fortunatamente, we all survive, and I try to jump into the sea to save our treasures, but my crew, they hold me back. I simply watch as all of my beautiful treasures sink to the bottom of the sea...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Is still down there now, I suppose... My dear old ship, my treasures... The fabulous sage's stone...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Listen, ragazzo\f1\emdash\f0 I want to see the stone again. Just one time before I die, s\'ec? Can you help? Can you find it for me?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.\par
Will you acquiesce to this request?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Aha ha ha! S\'ec, is the answer I expect. You have better things to do than to look for the treasures of an old man, eh? I understand.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Eh!? Veramente!? I no expect you to say yes! I expect you to think I am totally crazy!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Allora, the place where my ship sank, it is due east of Heliodor. That is where you must look, ragazzo. The sage's stone is there still, I am certain! \'c8 certo!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Of course, is no easy thing to find the treasure at the bottom of the sea. Is impossible from the surface, for a start\f1\emdash\f0 you must dive down and look closely at the ocean floor.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I know it is a difficult request, and I no have many details to help you, but I have faith, ragazzo! I know you find the sage's stone, and you bring here to show me!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I want you to find the sage's stone, ragazzo. Is the most spectacular treasure I have ever seen! Search the seabed until you find the stone, and bring here to show me!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Allora, the place where my ship sank, it is due east of Heliodor. That is where you must look, ragazzo. The sage's stone is there still, I am certain! \'c8 certo!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Of course, is no easy thing to find the treasure at the bottom of the sea. Is impossible from the surface, for a start\f1\emdash\f0 you must dive down and look closely at the ocean floor.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I know it is a difficult request, and I no have many details to help you, but I have faith, ragazzo! I know you find the sage's stone, and you bring here to show me!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Hm? You seek the sage's stone, you say? You will struggle something fierce, I fear. The sea is so very vast and deep, you see.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But luckily for you I look around a lot. And guess what I saw when I was scanning the seabed west of here\f1\emdash\f0 a sparkly spot!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I sincerely hope it is the stone you seek. If not, you may be searching for days. Or weeks...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You got the sage's stone! Take it to show the old adventurer in Gondolia!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah! You come back, eh? And you have the sage's stone?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Aha ha ha! Si figuri, ragazzo! Never mind! Is no easy to find things at the bottom of the sea!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell <pc> hands the old man the sage's stone that he found down in Nautica.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Santo cielo! S\'ec! S\'ec, this is the sage's stone! This is the fabulous treasure that sink with my ship! I cannot believe that you find it!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...Hm? Che cosa? What you say? You want me to have it? No, no, no, ragazzo! You find the stone\f1\emdash\f0 you must keep it!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I wished to see it one last time, but the item itself, is no so important to me. Memories and friendships\f1\emdash\f0 these are the real treasures that I discover on my adventures. You will learn this too, I think!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And you make me an happy old man, also. Allora, you must take this, per favore. Is my way to say grazie!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Is that the sage's stone I see sparkling so wonderfully? It's so pretty and glittery!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I am so happy that I see the sage's stone one more time before I die. Is very beautiful, no? Bellissimo!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But such trinkets, these are not what adventures are for, ragazzo. Adventures are for experiencing excitement, forging friendships and making magnificent memories! Aha ha ha!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: H-Holy mackerel! You scared me, uncle! For a minute there, I thought you were one of the fishermen from the village.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: They ain't none too fond of mermaids, see. If they found out I was hanging out with one, they'd tan my hide good.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I came here to fish, and found her washed up on the shore.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Seems like she ain't feeling too good. She's got a frog in her throat the size of a coconut, and she can hardly talk.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The Kahuna's always telling us that mermaids ain't welcome in Lonalulu, but I feel so sorry for her, coughing and croaking like that. I can't just tell her to get gone.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You couldn't help me out, could you? I gotta help her fix up her throat before the fishermen find out she's here.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Have you ever heard of dulcet dulse? It's a kind of seaweed so soft and slippery it can soothe a sore throat wikiwiki! Could you go get me some? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.\par
Will you acquiesce to this request?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah, man... Well, don't tell anybody in Lonalulu about the mermaid, okay, uncle?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: R-Really!? Thanks, uncle! I heard you big city folk can be real cold fish, but you're super kind! I'll never trust what the grown-ups say ever again!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Lemme tell you about dulcet dulse: it only grows on this one little island, near some country up north that's crazy cold. Seriously, they have snow there and everything.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: All you gotta do is go get some, and then give it to the mermaid. Aloha, a hui hou, uncle! Come back soon! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm sorry... (cough) My throat, it's... (croak) Feeling so... (cough hack hawk) So sore right now, I cannot... (cough) I cannot... (hawk hack) Talk...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Would that I had some dulcet dulse\f1\emdash\f0 it is the only cure... But without any... (cough cough) I must... (croak hack hawk) Endure... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This island's coast boasts an abundance of dulcet dulse, the only seaweed needed to cure a sore throat. I've come to restock my supplies.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Mermaids love to sing, but a sore throat brings all singing to a standstill. That's why this weed is so highly sought after by the daughters of the waters. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If I don't get this mermaid all healed up before the fishermen find out she's here, there'll be hell to pay!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You gotta help me out, uncle! All I need you to do is find me some dulcet dulse and bring it back here. Meantime, I'll keep her hidden.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It only grows way off to the north, on a little island near a country that's crazy cold. Seriously, they have snow there and everything.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Soon as you've found some, bring it back here wikiwiki and give it to the mermaid. A hui hou, uncle! Come back soon! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey, uncle! You're looking pretty pleased with yourself. You found the dulcet dulse, didn't you? Go ahead and give it to the mermaid! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm sorry... (cough) My throat, it's... (croak) Feeling so... (cough hack hawk) So sore right now, I cannot... (cough) I cannot... (hawk hack) Talk...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Would that I had some dulcet dulse\f1\emdash\f0 it is the only cure... But without any... (cough cough) I must... (croak hack hawk) Endure... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Is that some... (cough cough) Dulcet dulse? Could you give it to me? My throat's as... (croak) As painful as a... (hack hawk) Throat can be... <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Please, have... (hack hawk) Pity... (croak) My throat is so... (cough) Sore... I need some dulcet dulse! I can't... (hack) Take this any more! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, thank you! (cough cough) Thank you! You're so very... (hawk hack) Kind... I'll just have a little nibble, if you don't... (croak) Mind... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: (chomp chomp chomp) La... La la...\par
LA LA LA LAAAAAAAAAAAA! \f3\u9834?\f0  \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My throat felt rough and raspy like a stony, sandy shore, but now it feels more mellow than it's ever felt before!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: At long last, I can sing again! I'll sing both near and far! Where once my voice went cough, cough, cough, it now goes la, la, laaa!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But there's a special reason why this brings me so much joy\f1\emdash\f0 now I've got my voice back, I can thank this darling boy!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He stayed with me through thick and thin! Protected me from danger! Who else but a true hero would do so much for a stranger? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell The mermaid's sore throat is cured! Talk to the little boy and let him know that all is well! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This island's coast boasts an abundance of dulcet dulse, the only seaweed needed to cure a sore throat. I've come to restock my supplies.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Mermaids love to sing, but a sore throat brings all singing to a standstill. That's why this weed is so highly sought after by the daughters of the waters.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...What's that? You met a mermaid with a frog in her throat, and you've come to collect the antidote?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Take some of mine! It's fine! I take a pride bordering on pomposity in my generosity\f1\emdash\f0 and as a mer-medic, I cannot allow an ailing mermaid to go unaided.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Feed her this remedial weed, and she shall surely be cured! Her vocal chords shall be sore no more! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
<pc> receives a piece of dulcet dulse! Head back to Lonalulu and give it to the mermaid with the sore throat! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Don't dilly-dally, shilly-shally or tarry\f1\emdash\f0 carry that dulcet dulse back to Lonalulu and make that mermaid's vocal chords sore no more! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Thanks, uncle! Now the mermaid can sing again!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Mermaids sure do have pretty voices. It's enough to make you wonder if all those scary stories the fishermen tell about them are really true.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Right, that's it\f1\emdash\f0 I'm not gonna believe everything the grown-ups tell me any more! I'm gonna keep my eyes and ears open and decide for myself!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Here, I want you to have these. You've really helped me out, and it's only right that I repay the favour! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Thank you, friend, for curing me. I am so very glad. Not only can I sing again, but I can thank this lad!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He stayed with me through thick and thin! Protected me from danger! Who else but a true hero would do so much for a stranger? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You delivered the dulcet dulse to the debilitated mermaid, didn't you? And I bet she's feeling better! Why, that weed works wonders! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Thanks, uncle! Now the mermaid can sing again!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Mermaids have a funny way of saying stuff, huh? But I like it! When she thanked me for staying with her in that sing-song style of hers, my heart started beating super fast!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Is... Is this what it feels like to be in love? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Thank you, friend, for curing me. I am so very glad. Not only can I sing again, but I can thank this lad!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He stayed with me through thick and thin! Protected me from danger! Who else but a true hero would do so much for a stranger? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The dulcet dulse that abounds around this island is highly sought after by the daughters of the water. It cures sore throats as fast as lightning\f1\emdash\f0 it's almost frightening!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It would be a good thing, but when those sirens start singing, they won't stop till your ears are ringing! Bwah hah hah hah! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The seas around Lonalulu are some of the finest fishing grounds in all Erdrea. You've only gotta dip your toe in and something's sure to bite! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh hey, friend. You've come at just the right time. Truth be told, we've been hauling in nothing but seawater lately.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I tried offering up some fresh fish to Kanaloa, the god of the sea, and praying for his blessings like our ancestors used to when times were tough, but no dice.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Guess I left it too late. Things have been so bad lately, all I could spare was a single sardine. That ain't gonna fill a baby's belly, let alone a sea god's.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now, if I could offer up some Kanaloamari made from a tentacular's tentacle, that'd get me in Kanaloa's good books for sure, but I ain't no fighter. There's no way I could take one of those things down.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You, on the other hand, are a tentacular-fighting fiend! You could totally bring one down in just the right way to turn its tentacles into Kanaloamari, right?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If the fish don't come back soon, the whole village could be history! You're the only one we can rely on, friend! Please, bring me some Kanaloamari before it's too late! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.\par
Will you acquiesce to this request?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Y-You won't help us out!? Hm. Fine. Guess you got your own problems...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'll just have to figure out a way to fill these crying kids' bellies all on my own... Ah, jeez... What am I gonna do...? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You will? Mahalo, friend! You really are the saviour of Lonalulu! You did it once, and you'll do it again, I just know you will!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Tentaculars tend to hang out around the coast to the north, near the little island east of Zwaardsrust.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But it ain't just a question of beating one to a pulp\f1\emdash\f0 to make an offering fit for a god, you'll have to finish one off with a pep power called Tempered Tantrum.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's a cross between Flame Slash and Hot Lick. Make sure you and your friends know how to pull off both those moves before you go sailing off into tentacular-infested waters.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Then, when you find one, land the finishing blow with Tempered Tantrum, and you'll slice and sear its tentacles into a perfect plateful of Kanaloamari! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Tentaculars tend to hang out around the coast to the north, near the little island east of Zwaardsrust.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But it ain't just a question of beating one to a pulp\f1\emdash\f0 to make an offering fit for a god, you'll have to finish one off with a pep power called Tempered Tantrum.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
