\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Then, when you find one, land the finishing blow with Tempered Tantrum, and you'll slice and sear its tentacles into a perfect plateful of Kanaloamari! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You cooked up some Kanaloamari! Head back to Lonalulu and give it to the fisherman standing near the harbour! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey, friend. Something smells good. Hold up\f1\emdash\f0 that isn't the smell of Kanaloamari, is it? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Huh. You trying out a new cologne or something? Smells kinda fishy if you ask me. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Uiha! Talk about a generous serving! I never saw anything like it!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This'll get us into Kanaloa's good books for sure! As soon as the sea god's had his fill, I'll bet the ocean will be back to how it used to be in no time!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Our little keikis ain't gonna go hungry no more. Thank goodness for that...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Mahalo, friend! I can't thank you enough for what you've done. We don't got much here, but what's ours is yours. ...So take it! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: E komo mai, friend! Welcome back to Lonalulu! I offered up that Kanaloamari you brought me to the god of the sea.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's only a matter of time before the fish start biting again! You're the saviour of the village! Mahalo, mahalo! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh dear... I came here to research Erdwin's Lantern\f1\emdash\f0 I'm an astronomer, you see\f1\emdash\f0 but now it's gone and disappeared, so I'm not sure what to do...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Some of my colleagues have managed to find some shards of the Lantern out in the desert, though. I've seen a couple, and they look absolutely fascinating! I'd love to perform a few experiments on one!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But I've heard that the desert's crawling with monsters. There's no way someone like me could venture out there on a shard hunt...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You look like you can handle yourself, though. I don't suppose you'd be able to go out there and find one for me, would you?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.\par
Will you acquiesce to this request?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh. Well, I suppose it was rather a ridiculous thing to ask a complete stranger... I'm sorry, I'm just getting a bit panicky thinking that I might not be able to proceed with my research...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Really? Oh, thank you! As far as I heard it, the shards have been turning up in the desert to the north of Gallopolis.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you could find one and bring it to me, I'd be ever so grateful. I'll be waiting here for you, alright?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I need a shard of Erdwin's Lantern in order to continue my research. My colleagues tell me that several have been found in the desert to the north of Gallopolis.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you could find one and bring it to me, I'd be ever so grateful. I'll be waiting here for you, alright?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You found a Lantern shard! You should take it to the astronomer near the paddock in Gallopolis.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I can't prove any of my theories until I perform the necessary experiments... And I simply can't do that without a Lantern shard...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: ...Hm? Oh, I'm sorry! I didn't see you there! Wait\f1\emdash\f0 does this mean you've found a Lantern fragment for me?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh... Well, that's alright... I'm sorry, I got a little bit ahead of myself there...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You have!? Oh, thank you so much! I'll start preparing my experiments right away!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: B-But these are...!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, gosh! Now that is fascinating! Do you see these runes on the shard you brought me? These are the same ones that are on those ruins in the desert\f1\emdash\f0 the ones that are said to date from ancient times!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This reinforces my theory that Erdwin's Lantern contained the power of the ancient hero for whom it was named!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The meaning of the runes is a bit more mysterious, though. It's something like \lquote entrusted to you...people of the future\rquote ... What does that mean? Did Erdwin entrust us with his power?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm going to need to research this in a lot more depth!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This Lantern shard could potentially lead to some really groundbreaking discoveries! Thank you for going to all the trouble of getting it for me. Here\f1\emdash\f0 a little token of my gratitude.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Thanks to that shard you brought me, I've been able to ascertain that the runes on the Lantern are the same as the runes on the ancient ruins out in the Celestial Sands.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This reinforces my theory that Erdwin's Lantern contained the power of the ancient hero for whom it was named!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The meaning of the runes is a bit more mysterious, though. It's something like \lquote entrusted to you...people of the future\rquote ... What does that mean? Did Erdwin entrust us with his power?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm going to need to research this in a lot more depth! It won't be easy, of course, but I'm prepared to make it my life's work if need be!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Whoa there, traveller! What's the rush? Didn't anybody ever tell you that haste makes waste?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Sometimes you've got to just sit back, relax, and listen to some sweet lute licks\f1\emdash\f0 like the ones I'm about to lay down! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey there, traveller. The name's Luter\f1\emdash\f0 Luter van Boss. You won't believe this, but I only went and left my masterpiece in a monster-infested forest.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Luter van Boss\cell That song was a piece of my heart! A piece of my soul! It's the message I want to send to the world! It means everything to me!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Luter van Boss\cell ...Hm? How could I be so foolish as to leave it behind? Heaven knows! But one thing's for sure\f1\emdash\f0 I'm so angry with myself, I can't write another note!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Luter van Boss\cell I wish that I could get it back, but I'm a luter not a fighter. I don't even own a sword...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Luter van Boss\cell You, on the other hand, look like you can handle yourself. Will you help me get my masterpiece back? I'd be super grateful if you would\f1\emdash\f0 always and forever! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.\par
Will you acquiesce to this request?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Luter van Boss\cell You won't help me? Give me the reason! Can't you feel the hot, hot heat of my hot, hot heart?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Luter van Boss\cell You will!? Thank you, friend! I finished up my masterpiece when I was staying in a little hut to the south-west of the ruins of Dundrasil. I must have left it behind when I headed out.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Luter van Boss\cell I've tried to rewrite it, but I just can't get it right. That song was a part of me, man. Since I lost my baby, I haven't been myself...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Luter van Boss\cell But I believe in you! All of you! I'll wait right here until you come back to me with my opus in tow! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Luter van Boss\cell I finished up my masterpiece when I was staying in a little hut to the south-west of the ruins of Dundrasil. I must have left it behind when I headed out.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Luter van Boss\cell I've tried to rewrite it, but I just can't get it right. That song was a part of me, man. Since I lost my baby, I haven't been myself...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Luter van Boss\cell But I believe in you! All of you! I'll wait right here until you come back to me with my opus in tow! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You found Luter's opus! You should head back to the Warrior's Rest Inn near Zwaardsrust and return it to him! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
