\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey, Mister <pc>! They just told me Uncle Vince's statue's being sent to the orphanage!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And it's all thanks to you! Ohhh, I can't wait to see Uncle Vince's face when we show it to him!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You know he's a hero to all us kids at the orphanage, right? And heroes get statues of themselves\f1\emdash\f0 everybody knows that!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Thanks again for all your help! I couldn't have done it without you!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I wonder if the statue's been delivered yet... I can't wait to see Uncle Vince's face when we show it to him. All the other kids are going to love it too, I just know it!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I already know where I'm going to put it too. It's gonna be the centrepiece of the whole orphanage!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It has been almost... Yes... Six hundred years since the Royal Terrarium was... (yawn) Founded... We hope to mark this anniversary by unveiling a new... Hmm... Exhibit...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: A truly startling treasure from the world above... Yes... All of Nautica is looking forward to... (yawn) Seeing it... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: There's nothing I love more than the sound of cannon fire! As far as I'm concerned, every day should start and end with a bang!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My late husband, rest his soul, made all the cannons you'll see dotted around the village. And he made 'em just for me! They're louder than anything! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It has been almost... Yes... Six hundred years since the Royal Terrarium was... (yawn) Founded...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I was hoping to mark this anniversary by unveiling a new... Hmm... Exhibit...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: An item that I first saw when I was... Hmm... Still a fresh-faced hatchling... Yes... It caught my eye as I made the perilous journey from the beach to the... (yawn) Ocean...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Alas... I have been unable to find such a treasure on the ocean floor... Hmm... And being a sea turtle... (yawn) I cannot go to the world above to retrieve it...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But you, young man... (yawn) You can travel freely between the ocean and the land... If you were to assist me... Yes... I could acquire the exhibit of my dreams...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, my boy...? (yawn) Will you journey to the world above and bring me back... Hmm... This truly startling treasure...? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.\par
Will you acquiesce to this request?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I see... Well, I suppose you are the Luminary... No doubt you have more important matters at hand... Sorry to have... (yawn) Bothered you... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You will...? Truly, you are a kind soul... Very well... The item that I seek is very unique in shape... Almost like a long... (yawn) Legless squid...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I only caught a brief glimpse of it... Many years ago... (yawn) It was atop a cliff that towered above one of your human villages...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It was black and glossy... Hmm... And large enough to fit a mermaid inside... But then, just as I was admiring its beauty...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: BANG! It produced a cacophonous blast that sent a shock wave running across the surface of the sea... (yawn) It took my breath clean away...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ever since that day... Hmm... That enormous, explosive, sleek, black squid has never been far from my heart...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you have any idea where such an item might be found... (yawn) Could you bring one back to me from the world above...?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It will be the perfect exhibit... Yes... To celebrate the six hundredth anniversary of the founding of... (yawn) The Royal Terrarium... I am counting on you, Luminary... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: An enormous, explosive, sleek, black squid... Yes... Just like the one I saw when I was but a hatchling... (yawn) It will be the perfect exhibit to celebrate the Royal Terrarium's anniversary...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You are a well travelled fellow, Luminary... Hmm... Surely the settlement I remember it being near is one you have... (yawn) Visited on your wanderings...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you think you might know where to find one... (yawn) Pray, go there and bring it back to me... With such an exotic exhibit, this anniversary is sure to go with a bang...! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Aloha, friend. Long time no see! What can I do for you? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell <pc> explains that the curator of a certain museum wants to exhibit an enormous, explosive, sleek, black squid-like object, and one of the cannon lady's cannons might just fit the bill. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He aha ke 'ano!? Where do you get off, calling my beautiful babies squids!? I'll put you over my knee, mister!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Still... If this curator guy likes my late husband's cannons enough to wanna put one on a pedestal, he must have his head screwed on right.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Sure, friend. You got it. I'll let you borrow the biggest, shiniest, most ear-splitting cannon in my collection! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell <pc> receives the kanono cannon! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Let me know when it's due to go on display\f1\emdash\f0 I'll come see it! Ooh, I can't wait! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You convinced the cannon lady to lend you the kanono cannon! You should head back to the Royal Nautican Terrarium and give it to the curator! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ohhh...? What's that you're carrying, Luminary...? (yawn) Is it an enormous, explosive, sleek, black, squid-like object that's big enough to swallow a mermaid...? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hmm... Such a treasure will no doubt be difficult to source... As the curator of this establishment, I know how hard it can be to track down such exquisite items...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But the six hundredth anniversary of the founding of the Terrarium is... (yawn) Fast approaching... Please hurry... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Yes...! This is it...! This is the very sleek, black, squid-like item I have been... (yawn) Looking for...!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: What's that you say? It is actually a type of weapon...? And it makes a loud noise when it fires a... (yawn) Metal ball into the air...?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ho ho ho... You humans will fight with anything\f1\emdash\f0 even sleek, black squids...!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I always knew that you were a warlike species, but this is a revelation... The study of human society is endlessly fascinating...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Thank you, Luminary... (yawn) This is the perfect exhibit with which to honour... Hmm... The six hundredth anniversary of the museum's founding...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Please allow me to give you this in return... Yes... From all of us here at the Royal Terrarium... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I forgot to ask\f1\emdash\f0 which museum was it exactly that wanted to put one of my cannons on display?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...The Royal Nautican Terrarium? Never heard of it! I've never even heard of a place called Nautica before. Must be a long way away, I guess. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You humans are strange and complex creatures... Yes... I have been studying your society for decades... (yawn) And yet there is so much I still do not understand...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But that is what makes such research so rewarding... Hmm... We of the Royal Nautican Terrarium must continue to study your kind until we know you like the backs of our fins...! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I am a hatchling lawyer\f1\emdash\f0 until now, my only cases have been minor misdemeanours: drunken dabs, jayswimming plaices.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But now I find myself entangled in the prosecution of one accused of infringing our kingdom's constitution! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Bless my sole! You won't believe this\f1\emdash\f0 I was on my usual morning swim about the plaice when that merman swam up from out of nowhere and tried to take a bite out of me! I was dumbfloundered!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I mean, I wouldn't have minded if he'd just asked me first, but preying on people without their permission is a whole different kettle of fish!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ooh, it's enough to make you green about the gills... You agree, don't you? You can't just grab a passing guppy and start eating them\f1\emdash\f0 you've got to give them a chance to swim away first, right? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You mean you're on the merman's side!? You think he haddock case for dismissal!? What kind of a fish are you!? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Exactly! I knew a fellow fish would understand the scale of this affront to deep-sea decency! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: As Justice of the Court Ship, I must judge each case before me. Some drip with deepest intrigue while some others frankly bore me.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Today's defendant is accused of breaking from tradition, and feasting on a fish without first asking its permission. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It all happened a few months ago. I'd been living on nothing but seaweed for weeks when that delicious-looking fish swam by\f1\emdash\f0 my greed exceeded my need, and I did my misdeed.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He just looked so lovely and lively... Before I knew it, I'd jumped in and was nibbling on his fresh, fishy fins!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I didn't mean to be unkind, but in hindsight, I should have asked him if he minded. Now I'm in a bind\f1\emdash\f0 I might get fined, or even confined! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The blockhead in the dock is my own dear brother. The fool tried to feast on a fish without asking first.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Still, he stopped as soon as he saw he was in the wrong, and us fishfolk gobble up guppies and snack on snappers all the time. I only hope the judge sees it the same way... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: An adventurer, are ya? It ain't often we get folks like you comin' 'ere. This island's a place for 'ermits, exiles an' other assorted outcasts.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When I was younger I got up to all sorts\f1\emdash\f0 piratin' an' pillagin' an' the like\f1\emdash\f0 but now I spend me days just starin' out to sea.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: This ain't no place for a globetrottin' traveller like you. I reckon it's 'igh time you were on yer way. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I am the legal counsel of the merman on the stand. He's been accused of flouting Nautica's supreme command.\par
*: He saw a tasty-looking fish and, by his own admission, he sank his teeth into it without asking its permission.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I need to show the judge he's not a criminal at heart, but hatchling lawyer that I am, I don't know where to start!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If I could read my mentor's casebooks\f1\emdash\f0 even just a little\f1\emdash\f0 I'm sure that I could build a case to safeguard his acquittal.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I need to go and borrow them, but now the court's in session, I cannot leave! My client's sealed his fate with his confession!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If only I could quote those notes, I'm sure that he'd go free! Oh Luminary, will you go and bring them back for me? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.\par
Will you acquiesce to this request?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It's not your fault, it's mine\f1\emdash\f0 I should have known I'd need those notes... But what to do? It's down to me whether he sinks or floats... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Oh, thank you, Luminary! You're as kind as kind can be! My mentor was an ace attorney, famed throughout the sea.\par
*: It was to follow in his footsteps that I studied law\f1\emdash\f0 alas, he left us long ago, and now lives on the shore.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He built a hut upon a tiny island to the west, and hid himself away in self-inflicted house arrest.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: As you may surmise, he was an odd, unsocial sort...but always kind at heart, and a true maestro in the court!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If you could ask him for his notes on all the trials he stood at, I may yet get the chance to prove the law's something I'm good at! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: As Justice of the Court Ship, I must judge each case before me. Some drip with deepest intrigue while some others frankly bore me.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Today's defendant is accused of breaking from tradition, and feasting on a fish without first asking its permission.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The fishes are our friends, and yes, sometimes they are our food, but if you don't obey the law, you're asking to be sued. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My client isn't blameless\f1\emdash\f0 he admits he bit the fish\f1\emdash\f0 but then again, fish feature in many a merman dish.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: In this case, the plaintiff's claim for legal restitution is based on the first clause of the Nautican constitution.\par
*: \lquote All fishfolk are our friends, even if they are our food. To eat them is permitted only if one is not rude.\rquote\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: These words were written by the very first Queen of the Sea\f1\emdash\f0 to go against them is a most atrocious felony!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If I could read my mentor's casebooks\f1\emdash\f0 even just a little\f1\emdash\f0 I'm sure that I could build a case to safeguard his acquittal.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You'll find him on an island to the west inside his shack. Could you go and meet with him and bring his old notes back? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell <pc> asks the sailor if a lawyer from Nautica lives on the island. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...A lawyer from Nautica? You must be talkin' about the Sealicitor. 'E's an old mate o' mine.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When me old pirate crew dumped me 'ere and sailed off into the sunset, 'e let me stay with 'im in this 'ere cabin. Saved me life, so 'e did.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: 'E ain't around no more, though. Died a couple o' years back. A bright, sunny day it was. 'E was sittin' there, starin' out to sea, just like always, and then...gone. Just like that. (sigh)\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You a mate of 'is too, then? Sorry I ain't got better news for ya.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: 'Is stuff's in that chest over there if you wanna take somethin' to remember 'im by. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell There's a note scrawled on the title page of the Sealicitor's statutes. <pc> takes a closer look...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote I hereby bequeath my prized edicts unto you, my most honourable apprentice. May they aid you in delivering justice according to Nautican law.\rquote  \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You snagged the Sealicitor's statutes! Head back to Nautica and give them to the mermaid lawyer on the Court Ship!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Welcome back, my friend. Did your trip to the shore succeed? Did you meet my mentor and bring back the notes I need? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The trial isn't going well\f1\emdash\f0 and if the judge's frown is anything to go by, the defendant's going down!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I need to prove my client isn't guilty of this crime, or sure enough the poor old thing will soon be doing time!\par
*: Could you go and see my mentor on the western isle and bring his casebooks back before the last day of the trial? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...You didn't find my mentor on the island to the west\f1\emdash\f0 only this casebook, stashed inside his bedside treasure chest?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...This is exactly what I need\f1\emdash\f0 my mentor's legal knowledge! It's sure to help me more than all the stuff I learned in college!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Let's see... \lquote When one defends a charge of criminal fin-biting, there is an argument all able lawyers should be citing:\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \lquote Per se, that sharks, the enemies of all fish-kind, abhor feasting on fish with nibbled fins. Res ipsa loquitur.\rquote\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: A fish with nibbled fins is less likely to be predated...but how does that fact help my client be exonerated?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Wait\f1\emdash\f0 I think I understand\f1\emdash\f0 by chewing on the fish, he spared it from becoming a much bigger creature's dish!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The actions of the merman should not cause him to be sued! In fact, the plaintiff owes him a deep debt of gratitude!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm sure this line of reasoning will spare my client prison! When faced with such sound sense, the judge can make but one decision!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Thank you so much, Luminary! Here\f1\emdash\f0 this is for you. With all you've done for me, this is the least that I can do! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When me pirate crew gave me the old 'eave-'o and dumped me 'ere, I 'ad so much 'ate in me 'eart. It was the Sealicitor 'oo made me see the light.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: 'E used to spend all day starin' out to sea. Thinkin' of 'ome, I shouldn't wonder... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'll do just as my mentor asked and read all his decrees, then be the lawyer who delivers justice to the seas!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But first I need to get this current case out of the way\f1\emdash\f0 and now I've read his notes, I know exactly what to say!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: To whit: that sharks, the enemies of all fish-kind, abhor feasting on fish with nibbled fins. Res ipsa loquitur! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: S\'e6ll, wanderer. I am a soldier of Sniflheim. I came here with my younger brother to eradicate the killing machines that have been plaguing the Sn\'e6rfelt of late.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: All was proceeding as planned...until that blood-red robot appeared. A terrifying Type G0, far more powerful than its cousins, with murder on its metallic mind.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: We battled the beast with all our strength, and at long last, we prevailed...but at great cost.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My brother did not survive his injuries. I dragged myself to this cabin, and have been resting here ever since. Alas, I still do not have the strength to stand...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Since our parents passed away, my brother was the only family I had. We swore that we would always be together. I will never forgive that Type G0 for taking him from me...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I will not rest until every Type G0 in Erdrea is reduced to a smoking pile of cogs and sprockets! I will make them taste my pain a thousandfold!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You fight for justice, do you not? While I recover from my wounds, will you slay a Type G0 in my stead? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.\par
Will you acquiesce to this request?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, no matter. One day I will be fully healed, and on that day, every Type G0 in Erdrea will feel my wrath! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You will? Thank you, friend. The Type G0s are the commanders of the robot army. They only ever appear alongside their killing machine subordinates.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: They appear on the front lines only rarely, but if you keep fighting their footsoldiers, one is sure to show its fiendish face eventually.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The killing machines congregate in the Sn\'e6rfelt near the frozen fjord. The Type G0s will not be far behind them.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But I beg you, do not overstretch yourself. Beat one, and bring back a piece of its inner workings as proof. This will suffice. The fiends must pay for what they have done, but not at the cost of yet more lives. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You got yourself a Type G0 sprocket! Take it back to the Sniflheimian soldier in the scholar's cabin and give it to him! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You will? Thank you, friend. The Type G0s are the commanders of the robot army. They only ever appear alongside their killing machine subordinates.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: They appear on the front lines only rarely, but if you keep fighting their footsoldiers, one is sure to show its fiendish face eventually.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The killing machines congregate in the Sn\'e6rfelt near the frozen fjord. The Type G0s will not be far behind them.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But I beg you, do not overstretch yourself. Beat one, and bring back a piece of its inner workings as proof. This will suffice. The fiends must pay for what they have done, but not at the cost of yet more lives. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: S\'e6ll, wanderer. How goes the fight against the Type G0s? Do you come bearing the blood-red innards of one who fell at your hand? <yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Those fiends killed my brother\f1\emdash\f0 the only family I had. They must pay for their crimes! I will not rest until their entire race is extinguished once and for all! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Yes... This is indeed a part of one... Ha! How do you like that, fiend? This is what you get for\f1\emdash\f0 ...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: ......\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Thank you, friend, for doing as I asked. But let this be an end to it. This hatred, this destruction\f1\emdash\f0 it must stop.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When I held the sprocket in my hand, I realised something.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If I spend my life seeking revenge, I will become everything I hate. I will be just like a Type G0, living only for death and destruction.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My hatred blinded me to what is truly important: honouring the memory of my dear, departed brother.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now I see the light\f1\emdash\f0 and it is thanks to you. I will return to Sniflheim at the earliest opportunity and live life as my brother would have wanted. Please, take this with my thanks. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: S\'e6ll, friend. Thank you for all you did for me. I have abandoned all thoughts of revenge. From now on, I will live my own life.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My brother brought so much joy to the world\f1\emdash\f0 now I must do so in his place. This is surely the best way to honour his memory. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The lady of this house is a keen collector of classic literature. As her butler, it often falls to me to do the collecting on her behalf.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Many years ago, she dispatched me to Arboria to pick up a particularly rare volume. At the time, I was aggrieved to be sent on such an arduous journey, but looking back now, it was quite the adventure! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell The books are old and faded, and <pc> can't make out any of the titles. They must have been here for quite some time. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: \lquote Dost thou recall, my love, when we two did gaze upon the beauty of all Erdrea?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \lquote The sky, so deep and blue, did seem like to swallow us whole. The sea burn'd madder red, stain'd by the light of the setting sun. And all around us, Yggdrasil's leaves did shine with the light of life...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \lquote The heavenly vision I saw with thee that day seared itself into my very soul. Ne'er shall I forget it, though I live for all eternity.\rquote\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: ...Fair words indeed, would you not agree? It is the text of a letter, written by an unknown hand, that was discovered inside a book in the library here in Arboria.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I have read it so many times now that I am able to recite its contents by heart.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: However, the letter is incomplete. I have searched and searched for the second page, but alas, it is nowhere to be found. Not here in Arboria, at any rate...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You travel a great deal, do you not? Would you aid me in searching for the letter's no doubt lyrical and heart-wrenching ending? \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.\par
Will you acquiesce to this request?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: What a shame. No doubt the letter's end is just as eloquent as its beginning. It is a pity you will not be witness to its true beauty.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: You will? Oh, thank you! The villagers tell me that the first page of the letter was discovered between the pages of an ancient Arborian tome.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Alas, this tome was sold some years ago to a Gallopolitan noblewoman. It is my belief that the second page of the letter is inside the book still.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I would ask that you journey to Gallopolis and enquire at the homes of the noble families of that realm. I wish you the best of luck in your search.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: \lquote Dost thou recall, my love, when we two did gaze upon the beauty of all Erdrea?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \lquote The sky, so deep and blue, did seem like to swallow us whole. The sea burn'd madder red, stain'd by the light of the setting sun. And all around us, Yggdrasil's leaves did shine with the light of life...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \lquote The heavenly vision I saw with thee that day seared itself into my very soul. Ne'er shall I forget it, though I live for all eternity.\rquote\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: ...Fabulous, is it not? The more I recite these words, the more meaningful they seem! I must know how the missive ends!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The villagers tell me that the first page of the letter was discovered in the pages of an ancient Arborian tome.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Alas, this tome was sold some years ago to a Gallopolitan noblewoman. It is my belief that the second page of the letter is inside the book still.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I would ask that you journey to Gallopolis and enquire at the homes of the noble families of that realm. I wish you the best of luck in your search.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The lady of this house is a keen collector of classic literature. As her butler, it often falls to me to do the collecting on her behalf.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Many years ago, she dispatched me to Arboria to pick up a particularly rare volume. At the time, I was aggrieved to be sent on such an arduous journey, but looking back now, it was quite the adventure!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...What became of that book, you ask? I am afraid that we no longer have it. A travelling woodcutter who once stayed here took it with him when he left.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He was so enthralled by its contents that my lady reluctantly agreed to part with it. It was the only way to make him leave.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: If I remember correctly, he said that he was on his way to a cabin in the Manglegrove. Whether he still resides there now, I do not know... \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You've read the second page of the letter that the minstrel told you about! You should make a copy of it to show him! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell The books are old and faded, and <pc> can't make out any of the titles. They must have been here for quite some time.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell While squinting at their spines, he spots the corner of a piece of torn and tattered paper poking out of one of them!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell This must be the second half of the letter that the minstrel in Arboria told you about! <pc> takes it out and reads it...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote But wherefore must it be so? This world may be unchanged\f1\emdash\f0 as beauteous as e'er it was\f1\emdash\f0 but without thee, all seemeth grey and muted...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote My chest is fit to burst! My dearest Erdwin, each new day I must endure without thee pierceth my heart like a dagger!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote I can do naught but cling vainly to the hope that one day we might be reunited at last. Until then, my songs are thine and thine alone. I pray that they might reach thee, wherever thou might be...\rquote  \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Ah, you have returned! Well? Did you find the second page of the letter?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: What a pity. Pray, do not end your search yet. I cannot rest until I know how the missive ends! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell <pc> hands over his copy of the letter.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Yes! This is it! Pray allow me to read both parts together. Ahem...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \lquote Dost thou recall, my love, when we two did gaze upon the beauty of all Erdrea?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \lquote The sky, so deep and blue, did seem like to swallow us whole. The sea burn'd madder red, stain'd by the light of the setting sun. And all around us, Yggdrasil's leaves did shine with the light of life...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \lquote The heavenly vision I saw with thee that day seared itself into my very soul. Ne'er shall I forget it, though I live for all eternity.\rquote\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \lquote But wherefore must it be so? This world may be unchanged\f1\emdash\f0 as beauteous as e'er it was\f1\emdash\f0 but without thee, all seemeth grey and muted...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \lquote My chest is fit to burst! My dearest Erdwin, each new day I must endure without thee pierceth my heart like a dagger!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: \lquote I can do naught but cling vainly to the hope that one day we might be reunited at last. Until then, my songs are thine and thine alone. I pray that they might reach thee, wherever thou might be...\rquote\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: My word... Such passion! And that name: \lquote Erdwin\rquote ... Could it be that this letter is addressed to the Luminary of Legend?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Of course! The tales tell of the star-crossed romance between Mighty Erdwin and the Great Sage Serenica. This can only be a love letter from Serenica herself!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: What an honour it is to read such heartfelt words from the pen of one so illustrious! One feels as if one is witnessing the glory of the Age of Heroes first-hand!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Pray, take this. It is but a token of the gratitude I feel for your having allowed me to read these beautiful words at long, long last. \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: A love letter from the Age of Heroes... Ahh, I could not have dreamed of anything more romantic than this!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I am brimming with ideas for a new song on the subject of Erdwin and Serenica's love\f1\emdash\f0 and it is all thanks to you! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: A love letter from the Age of Heroes... Ahh, I could not have dreamed of anything more romantic than this!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I am brimming with ideas for a new song on the subject of Erdwin and Serenica's love\f1\emdash\f0 and it is all thanks to you! \cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I had heard that the summit of Mt Pang Lai commanded a most marvellous view, but this surpasses all my expectations!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: It's simply breathtaking! I shall etch this image into my heart, and remember it until my dying day!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell There's an inscription carved into the tree trunk. It's rather hard to read, but if <pc> squints, he can just about make it out...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote This is truly one of the most magnificent, spectacular and indeed utterly gobsmacking views I have seen in my long career as a connoisseur of splendid scenery!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote But what use is a beautiful view when one is all alone?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote I have realised that if a man has his love beside him, even the most paltry view will be filled with beauty. In conclusion, I must find a wife! Signed, Vincenzo Turismo\rquote\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: I had heard that the summit of Mt Pang Lai commanded a most marvellous view, but this surpasses all my expectations!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: It's simply breathtaking! I shall paint this image onto the canvas of my heart, and remember it until my dying day!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: My name is Hugo, and I have devoted my life to travelling the world in search of the most marvellous views in existence.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hugo\cell Now, I know we've only just met, but I have a very strong suspicion that I have found in you a soulmate\f1\emdash\f0 a fellow devotee of jaw-dropping views and transcendent vistas!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hugo\cell And with your youthful vigour and limber limbs, I have a feeling you may be able to witness the most marvellous view of all! So, how about it\f1\emdash\f0 do you want to join me in the exalted ranks of the scenery-seekers?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.\par
Will you acquiesce to this request?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hugo\cell\par
That is...unfortunate... I have clearly misjudged you. I believed you to have a lofty spirit and a love for beauty, but clearly that is not the case...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hugo\cell But being a scenery-seeker is not for everyone, and the last thing I would want to do is pressure anyone into it. Well, I wish you luck in all your endeavours, whatever they may be!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hugo\cell\par
I knew it! I could tell from your face that you were a kindred spirit! May I heartily welcome you to the most exclusive club imaginable\f1\emdash\f0 the secretive association of the scenery-seekers!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hugo\cell Now, without further ado, let me point you in the direction of the most marvellous sight of all\f1\emdash\f0 the view from the soaring, cloud-kissed heights eulogised by the legendary Vincenzo Turismo, a member of our order!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hugo\cell According to his celebrated writings, there is a great mountain to the south of Heliodor from which a truly unparalleled view of Erdrea can be enjoyed.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hugo\cell Apparently, he experienced something of an epiphany upon seeing it, and carved his thoughts into the trunk of a nearby tree, that they might be preserved forever. But he never divulged exactly what it was he wrote...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hugo\cell I want you to do something for me\f1\emdash\f0 head into the rocky south of Heliodor, find that mountain and share with me the insights of my hero and mentor!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hugo\cell I would go myself, but I am afraid my knees are not what they were\f1\emdash\f0 even making this comparatively easy ascent was a struggle. Please, as a new member of our order, you must do this! You simply must!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hugo\cell I want you to witness the most marvellous sight of all\f1\emdash\f0 the view from the soaring, cloud-kissed heights eulogised by the legendary scenery-seeker, Vincenzo Turismo.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hugo\cell According to his celebrated writings, there is a great mountain to the south of Heliodor from which a truly unparalleled view of Erdrea can be enjoyed.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hugo\cell Apparently, he experienced something of an epiphany upon seeing it, and carved his thoughts into the trunk of a nearby tree, that they might be preserved forever. But he never divulged exactly what it was he wrote...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hugo\cell I want you to do something for me\f1\emdash\f0 head into the rocky south of Heliodor, find that mountain and share with me the insights of my hero and mentor!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hugo\cell I would go myself, but I am afraid my knees are not what they were\f1\emdash\f0 even making this comparatively easy ascent was a struggle. Please, as a new member of our order, you must do this! You simply must!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell <pc> finds an old dead tree.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell There's an inscription carved into the trunk. It's rather hard to read, but if he squints, he can just about make it out...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote This is truly one of the most magnificent, spectacular and indeed utterly gobsmacking views I have seen in my long career as a connoisseur of splendid scenery!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote But what use is a beautiful view when one is all alone?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote I have realised that if a man has his love beside him, even the most paltry view will be filled with beauty. In conclusion, I must find a wife! Signed, Vincenzo Turismo\rquote\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You found the inscription left by the legendary scenery-seeker! Head back to the summit of Mt Pang Lai and tell Hugo what it says!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hugo\cell Well, if it isn't the newest member of the secretive association of scenery-seekers! So, did you find Vincenzo Turismo's message?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hugo\cell Oh, that's a shame. But perhaps I'm expecting too much too soon\f1\emdash\f0 you are new to the vista-hunting game after all.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell <pc> tells Hugo what was carved into the tree trunk...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hugo\cell Well, knock me down with a feather! Not in a million years would I have imagined that Vincenzo Turismo's profound insight as he looked down upon the world was that he needed a wife!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hugo\cell But thinking about it, solitude is something of an occupational hazard for we scenery-seekers. I myself have been so busy scaling these heady heights that I have neglected to think about finding a life partner...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hugo\cell B-But I don't regret it for a second! N-Not a single solitary second! No! I have lived my life in pursuit of a higher cause\f1\emdash\f0 for who needs a wife when a resplendent vista is unfolding beneath one's feet?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hugo\cell I have chosen this life, and I stand by my choice! Besides, I am not alone\f1\emdash\f0 beauty is my bride, the wide blue yonder is my beloved, and the whispering breeze is my most faithful friend!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hugo\cell No, my choice was the right one! And now I have introduced a bright young talent to the marvels of scenery-seeking too! Speaking of which, let me give you a small reward for all your efforts...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hugo\cell My knees may not be what they were, but I shall continue to pursue beautiful views and etch them into my heart for as long as there is breath in my body!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell There's an inscription carved into the tree trunk. It's rather hard to read, but if <pc> squints, he can just about make it out...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote This is truly one of the most magnificent, spectacular and indeed utterly gobsmacking views I have seen in my long career as a connoisseur of splendid scenery!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote But what use is a beautiful view when one is all alone?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\lquote I have realised that if a man has his love beside him, even the most paltry view will be filled with beauty. In conclusion, I must find a wife! Signed, Vincenzo Turismo\rquote\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hugo\cell\par
I find my mind returning unbidden to thoughts of matrimony... There was that one rather appealing woman in the tavern in Heliodor whom I could not help but feel took a shine to me...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hugo\cell\par
Oh! Did I say that aloud!? The thought of marriage could not be further from my mind! What use would I have for a wife when I have the world's most beautiful views to enjoy?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Hugo\cell Anything I may have said about a certain lady in a certain tavern was just my senseless rambling! Please, pay me no mind!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Heliodor has always been a kingdom whose fighting prowess has been feared far and wide. Before Sir Hendrik and Sir Jasper, there were scores of famous knights who served the crown.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: In my youth, I aspired to join their number, and asked if I could be taken on as a novice. Sadly, I didn't quite cut the mustard...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Heh! You're a pretty tough customer, I can tell! I bet you've been in your fair share of battles over the years, haven't you?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Well, if there's one thing I love, it's discussing mighty warriors and sharing tales of derring-do.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But it takes two to tango, and mighty warriors are nothing without monsters to cross swords with!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And it just so happens that I've heard of a beauty! It's called Harmachis, and it rules over an army of bilhaws from atop the Hotto Steppe!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I've been hearing terrific things about how tough it is, but I want to hear from someone with first-hand experience. Will you go and fight it for me?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.\par
Will you acquiesce to this request?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Gah! All my hopes cruelly dashed against the rocks! Well, I suppose it was a lot to ask. Still, I can't say I'm not disappointed...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I knew it! I knew you wouldn't let me down! Now, let me tell you everything I know...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: As I mentioned, he lives on the Hotto Steppe\f1\emdash\f0 that's south of Mount Huji\f1\emdash\f0 on some kind of high plateau. But he only shows himself to those who can prove themselves strong enough.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: And to do that, you'll need to beat up a load of his bilhaw minions.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now, go and lure him out so you can come back and tell me all about it! I want to hear all the gory details! Good luck\f1\emdash\f0 I know you can do this!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: On a high plateau on the Hotto Steppe south of Mount Huji, there dwells a mighty monster known as Harmachis. I want you to take him on in battle and tell me all about it.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But he won't reveal himself to any old warrior. No, first you'll need to prove yourself by beating up a load of his bilhaw minions.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: I'm rooting for you\f1\emdash\f0 I just know you can do it! And when you do, I want to hear all the gory details!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You beat Harmachis! Go back to Heliodor and give the old man a blow-by-blow account!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: So, you're back! And I can see that you must have bested Harmachis in battle!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...How can I tell, you ask? Why, I can see the wounds you still bear, the horror in your eyes\f1\emdash\f0 he was no ordinary foe, I can see that much!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Nor should he have been\f1\emdash\f0 for in truth, he was once a mighty general of the ruined realm of Zwaardsrust!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But fate caught up with him when he faced a ruthless foe, who led him into a terrible trap from which he and his men could not free themselves.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He fell into a state of utter despair at his defeat, and his body rose again to become the bitter, brutal Harmachis. But by defeating him, I feel certain that you have enabled him to find peace at last.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You fought bravely, and you rescued a mighty warrior from a living hell. Take this\f1\emdash\f0 you have earned it.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: According to the stories, Harmachis was once a mighty general of the ruined realm of Zwaardsrust.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But fate caught up with him when he faced a ruthless foe, who led him into a terrible trap from which he and his men could not free themselves.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He fell into a state of utter despair at his defeat, and his body rose again to become the bitter, brutal Harmachis. But by defeating him, I feel certain that you have enabled him to find peace at last.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It is truly an honour to have met a warrior mighty enough to have bested such a foe. I'll be boring my grandchildren with this little tale until my dying day!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hee hee hee hee! I knew you'd be coming to Mistress Bev's before long\f1\emdash\f0 I saw it in the stars, didn't I!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mistress Bev\cell Now, I used to make a decent livin' tellin' fortunes an' floggin' a little 'oly water on the side, but since them flippin' monsters went an' got loads tougher, me 'oly water's stopped workin'!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mistress Bev\cell That meant people stopped buyin' it, an' I've been losin' sleep ever since. I don't wanna end up on the streets, do I! Anyway, I took a little look at what's up ahead, an' I seen me knight in shinin' armour!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mistress Bev\cell 'E was a silky-'aired lad wiv a kind 'eart 'oo was keen as mustard to find me the divine dew I need to power up me merchandise an' get me business back on its feet! So come on, darlin', wot d'you say?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.\par
Will you acquiesce to this request?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mistress Bev\cell ...Bah! You fink you can just walk away from yer destiny, do ya? Nah, I've seen it written in the stars\f1\emdash\f0 you'll be back, sunshine!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mistress Bev\cell Hee hee hee hee! I knew you'd say that! Nuffink gets past the magnificent Mistress Bev!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mistress Bev\cell Now, clear out yer lug'oles an' listen up! Divine dew comes rollin' off the leaves o' none other than the World Tree itself!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mistress Bev\cell Accordin' to wot I saw in me crystal ball, there's all these waterfalls an' little ponds up in the First Forest. If you 'ave a poke round there, yer bound to find some.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mistress Bev\cell Go an' find some divine dew an' bring it back to Mistress Bev. I know you'll do it\f1\emdash\f0 it's written in the stars! Hee hee hee!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mistress Bev\cell Wot I need you to do is get 'old o' some divine dew from the First Forest an' bring it back 'ere so I can flog it an' finally pay me rent.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mistress Bev\cell Accordin' to wot I saw in me crystal ball, there's all these waterfalls an' little ponds up in the First Forest. If you 'ave a poke around there, yer bound to find some.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mistress Bev\cell Go an' find some divine dew an' bring it back to Mistress Bev. I know you'll do it\f1\emdash\f0 it's written in the stars! Hee hee hee!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You found some divine dew! Take it back to Mistress Bev in downtown Heliodor!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mistress Bev\cell Hee hee hee hee! 'Ello there! So, 'ave you brought back some divine dew for good old Mistress Bev?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mistress Bev\cell ...You wot!? Well, not to worry\f1\emdash\f0 it's just a matter o' time before you do. It's written in the stars, after all! Hee hee hee hee!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mistress Bev\cell Hee hee hee hee! I'm gonna make a killin' wiv this stuff! Nice one! Now, I ain't got nuffink to give you as a reward...but I can tell yer fortune for free!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mistress Bev\cell Tell me, mysterious rulers of fate...\par
What's this lank-'aired lad 'ere got on his plate...?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mistress Bev\cell ...Somefink's comin' through loud an' clear! The spirits are talkin' to me!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mistress Bev\cell ...You wot!? \lquote The Luminary needs that divine dew more than you, Mistress Bev\rquote , they're sayin'! An' if I don't 'and it over, I'm destined to break a tooth on a stale slice o' bread an' die alone an' in agony! Crikey!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mistress Bev\cell\par
Well, there's no use arguin' wiv the powers o' destiny, is there? I don't want to meet me end at the 'ands of a loaf o' bread, do I?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mistress Bev\cell Looks like it's your lucky day, darlin'. S'pose you 'ave got to save the world an' fulfil yer destiny an' all that... Fair enough. I ain't about to stand in yer way.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mistress Bev\cell I'll just pop it in a bottle for ya, shall I? Better start finkin' of another way to pay me rent, an' all...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mistress Bev\cell I dunno if you knew this, but divine dew's also known as pep pop. Like the name says, it gets ya pepped up an' ready for anyfink. It's a good plan to 'ave a drop or two 'andy when you go into battle.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mistress Bev\cell Now, go an' rid the world of evil, will ya? Then I can tell everyone it was ol' Mistress Bev who 'elped the Luminary save the day! That should be good for business! Hee hee hee!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mistress Bev\cell I dunno if you knew this, but divine dew's also known as pep pop. Like the name says, it gets ya pepped up an' ready for anyfink. It's a good plan to 'ave a drop or two 'andy when you go into battle.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Mistress Bev\cell Now, go an' rid the world of evil, will ya? Then I can tell everyone it was ol' Mistress Bev who 'elped the Luminary save the day! That should be good for business! Hee hee hee!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Shhh! Be quiet! Can't you see I'm tryin' to 'ide!?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: Gah! An' there I was finkin' this was the perfect spot!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: 'Ang about! You ain't 'oo I thought you were! I thought me mates 'ad rumbled me! We're playin' 'ide-and-seek, you see.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But if some bloke wiv a silly 'airdo can just 'appen across me like that, I can't be 'idin' very well, can I? Gah. Must be losin' me touch...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: It sounds like I'm gonna 'ave to up me game! An' that means gettin' some tips from the one an' only All-Time 'Ide-an'-Seek Master!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Only problem is, 'e's a right pain to find\f1\emdash\f0 as you might expect. But I've got the perfect plan\f1\emdash\f0 I'm gonna get you to find 'im for me! You'd do that for me, wouldn't ya? Well, wouldn't ya?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.\par
Will you acquiesce to this request?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You ain't got the 'eart to 'elp me out!? Come on, mate\f1\emdash\f0 you wouldn't want me not bein' able to 'ide if 'orrible monsters came an' attacked the town now, would ya? Would ya?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Nice one! Now, this All-Time 'Ide-an'-Seek Master I'm talkin' about ain't gonna be easy to track down, but I 'appen to know he's somewhere in Octagonia.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: 'Ead to the orphanage there an' 'ave a sniff around. The kids there are pretty into their 'ide-an'-seek, so they should be able to point you in the right direction.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The most famous 'ide-an'-seek expert of 'em all is this bloke called Xero the Shadow. I want you to go to Octagonia, track 'im down an' find out the secret o' bein' a master o' disappearology!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: There's this orphanage over that way. The kids there are really into 'ide-an'-seek\f1\emdash\f0 they should be able to point you in the right direction.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: They don't call 'im the All-Time 'Ide-an'-Seek Master for nuffink, so 'e ain't gonna be easy to find, but I reckon you can do it!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hey, mister! Long time no see!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: ...What's that? Some kid asked you to find the All-Time Hide-and-Seek Master?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: You must mean Xero the Shadow! When he hides, nobody can ever find him! He's the best!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: He was here, but he left Octagonia a while back. I heard he headed toward the Champs Sauvage.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Sorry. Wish I could tell you more. It won't be easy to find him, but if anyone can do it, you can!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Xero was here, but he left Octagonia a while back. I heard he headed toward the Champs Sauvage.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Sorry. Wish I could tell you more. It won't be easy to find him, but if anyone can do it, you can!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Xero the Shadow\cell You did it! You found me! You won! I'm Xero the Shadow, the one they call the Knight of the Night! Or at least, the kids at the Orphanage in Octagonia do...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Xero the Shadow\cell ...What's that? You're wondering why I'm hiding here? Well, that's simple\f1\emdash\f0 I was looking for the ultimate hiding place. Somewhere nobody in Octagonia would ever find me.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Xero the Shadow\cell And who would ever think to look for a grown man in a school of small girls, right? I thought it was my greatest stroke of hiding genius yet!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Xero the Shadow\cell Trouble is, I was so busy congratulating myself on my brainwave that they caught me before I had a chance to hide, and locked me up in here thinking I was some kind of thief!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Xero the Shadow\cell But why would you have gone out of your way like this to find me? Is there something you need?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Xero the Shadow\cell ...What's that? You want to know the secret of becoming a hide-and-seek master? But how can I tell you that? I'm no master\f1\emdash\f0 you just found me, after all.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Xero the Shadow\cell ...Still, since you've come all this way, I'd be happy to tell you what I think is the most important thing about the disappearing game. It's simple\f1\emdash\f0 having fun with your friends.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Xero the Shadow\cell Nothing is as precious as friendship, and the fact that you might have pals who are actually willing to look for you instead of letting you rot in a cellar or gather dust in an attic is something to truly treasure.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You've learned a profound truth about hide-and-seek from the undisputed master! Head back to Heliodor and tell the little boy!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Wotcher! So, did you find 'im? Did you find out the secret o' bein' an 'ide-an'-seek master?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell\par
*: ...You wot!? The point of 'ide-an'-seek is 'avin' fun wiv yer mates!?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Wow... I've never looked at it like that before, but it's true, I s'pose\f1\emdash\f0 if you didn't 'ave anyone to play wiv, 'ide-an-seek wouldn't be much fun, would it...?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Yeah, that makes total sense! Nice one! I ain't gonna forget this! Every time I play from now on, I'll be sure to remember 'ow lucky I am to 'ave pals to play wiv!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Fanks, mate! You've changed me life! 'Ere, 'ave this as a little token o' me appreciation!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Xero's amazing! We call him the Knight of the Night!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: When I grow up, I want to be just as slippery, evasive and hard to pin down as him! He's my hero!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Xero the Shadow\cell It's not really my place to talk about the secret to being a hide-and-seek master. I mean, you found me, after all.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Xero the Shadow\cell But if I had to put my finger on it, I'd say the most important thing is having fun with your friends.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Xero the Shadow\cell Nothing is as precious as friendship, and the fact that you might have pals who are actually willing to look for you instead of letting you rot in a cellar or gather dust in an attic is something to truly treasure.\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: The most important fing about 'ide-an'-seek is to enjoy spendin' time wiv yer mates. I never looked at it that way before! This 'as changed me life!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Every time I play from now on, I'm gonna be thankful I've got mates to play wiv!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Now, if you wouldn't mind, d'you fink you could clear off? If you keep standin' there, me mates are gonna spot me!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hotto truly is a fascinating place. Being surrounded by high mountains as it is, it was largely left alone for centuries, and has consequently developed its own unique culture.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But that's not the only thing that's fascinating about the place\f1\emdash\f0 they say there's a hoard of ancient artefacts buried somewhere near the village. Yes, that's right\f1\emdash\f0 treasure!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Hotto truly is a fascinating place. Being surrounded by high mountains as it is, it was largely left alone for centuries, and has consequently developed its own unique culture.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: But that's not the only thing that's fascinating about the place\f1\emdash\f0 have you ever heard the tale of the treasure buried here by a shrine maiden many years ago? They say it may even include the legendary Bloodstone!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell *: Since the time of my great-grandfather, the men of my family have set out in search of that most priceless of gems. I am Iago, the latest in that noble line of treasure hunters!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Iago\cell And now, after all these years, I believe I can finally finish what my great-grandfather began! The tale I heard has convinced me that the jewel is here in Hotto! But I cannot take the final steps of my journey alone!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Iago\cell No, I shall need someone to assist me with the final chapter of my epic quest. Will you join me\f1\emdash\f0 will you help me find the hidden treasure of Hotto?\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.\par
Will you acquiesce to this request?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Iago\cell Ahh, that is a shame. I had planned to take the Bloodstone and let you have the rest of the treasure, but if you're not interested, you're not interested...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Iago\cell Heh heh! I thought you might say that! You are clearly a man with a taste for adventure and excitement\f1\emdash\f0 and what could be more exciting than buried treasure!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Iago\cell Now, the first thing we will need to do is locate the journal of the shrine maiden said to have buried the treasure. I have been led to believe that it still remains somewhere here in Hotto.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Iago\cell I hereby entrust you with the task of finding it, and using it to track down the treasure!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Iago\cell Bring me the Bloodstone\f1\emdash\f0 the rest you can keep!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Iago\cell For generations, my family have sought a certain precious gem. After years of fruitless wandering, I am now convinced that it is to be found here in Hotto.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Iago\cell I have been led to believe that the treasure was buried by a shrine maiden long ago, and that she left a journal describing the circumstances. If we can find that, it may lead us to the hoard!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Iago\cell I hereby entrust you with the task of finding it, and using it to track down the treasure!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Iago\cell Bring me the Bloodstone\f1\emdash\f0 the rest you can keep!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You've found the hidden hoard of Hotto! Head back to Iago at the inn and tell him the good news!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Iago\cell Ah, there you are, my partner in treasure hunting! So, how did it go? Did you manage to track down the hidden hoard of Hotto?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Iago\cell Oh well, that is a shame! But it's out there, I can feel it! And we cannot rest until it has been found!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Iago\cell Y-You found it! Finally, the epic endeavour my great-grandfather began all those years ago is at an end! There are no words to express my gratitude!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Iago\cell As you know, I am from a long and illustrious line of treasure hunters.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Iago\cell I can still remember my great-grandfather on his deathbed, looking me in the eye and telling me to continue his lifelong search for the Bloodstone...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Iago\cell And now it is finally at an end. Could I have done it without you? Perhaps not, my friend. Perhaps not. Truly, there are no words...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Iago\cell What there is though, is lots of lovely treasure! I shall take the Bloodstone, but the rest is all yours!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Iago\cell Without you, I may never have got my hands on the Bloodstone. There are no words to express my gratitude! Truly, you are my brother in arms! My greatest treasure hunting companion!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Iago\cell But in truth, I have a real brother also. A brother by blood. But he has no interest in treasure hunting\f1\emdash\f0 he seeks something else. He is a hunter of stunning scenery by the name of Hugo!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Iago\cell He is always on the lookout for grand vistas and breathtaking views. If you should ever run into him, be sure to say hello. The last time I saw him, I believe he said he was heading for some mountaintop shrine...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Prince Faris\cell Ah! My dear <pc>! I was hoping that you would come and visit. I have a favour to ask, you see\f1\emdash\f0 and I know that I can always count on my old friend!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Prince Faris\cell Now, as you can imagine, the appearance of that black star and the increased viciousness of the local monsters have put rather a strain on our brave desert knights.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Prince Faris\cell However, I do not know whether it is due to a lack of experience or a lack of concentration, but the sad truth is that most of our men are simply not up to the task. It does not bode well for the future...\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Prince Faris\cell Now, as you know, I am a practical prince, and I like to try and find solutions wherever possible. Can you imagine, therefore, how delighted I was to hear of a berry that boosts concentration on the battlefield!?\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Prince Faris\cell These miraculous fruits are known as pep pips, and they grow on the boughs of the Pepper Tree. Could I trouble you to fetch one of its branches for me? I will reward you handsomely, of course...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl\cell You've been asked to undertake a quest.\par
Will you acquiesce to this request?<yesno>\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Prince Faris\cell Oh... Very well... I am, uhh...sure to come up with another ingenious solution before long... Do let me know if you change your mind, though. Please...\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Prince Faris\cell I knew I could count on you, old friend! I would have asked one of my servants, but the Pepper Tree grows in a rather...tricky location... Thank goodness you came along when you did!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Prince Faris\cell The location in question is an elevated area in the northern part of the First Forest.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Prince Faris\cell I have heard that only certain special people are allowed to enter this place\f1\emdash\f0 but that is a trivial detail. You will have no problem gaining access, I am sure!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Prince Faris\cell A thousand thank yous once again for agreeing to help, old friend. It would seem that the future of Gallopolis is in our hands once more!\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Prince Faris\cell Our desert knights lack focus, <pc>! That is why I require a pep-pip-laden branch of the Pepper Tree\f1\emdash\f0 in order to boost their concentration on the battlefield!\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh290\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
\pard\intbl Prince Faris\cell The Pepper Tree grows in an elevated location in the northern part of the First Forest.\par
\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh581\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
\cellx1410\cellx10343 
